nts":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T13:00:13-08:00","id":59040,"title":"","content":"Thinking on it, I'm going to consider the end of y'all dealing with the barbarians to be the end of the 'session'. Therefore, I'ma dole out exp: everyone gets 4 exp, so far, +1 for Omicron on account of his 3-die stunt. For future reference exceptional all-round Role-playing (such as fleshing out your character's personal habits, tastes, backgrounds, etc through role-play) will also grant extra EXP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T18:18:02-08:00","id":59352,"title":"","content":"A note: Ba Rai is female, and Esstrayan is male. Their narrative is one of the princess and her knight in shining armor. Its just that the genders are reversed, without altering the roles at all. So Esstrayan is a princess, and that means he likes to be called 'Lady' and wears ornate dresses, even though, for all intents and purposes, he's a he (well, as much as a Fae can have a gender).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T18:29:33-08:00","id":59363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=59352#post59352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A note: Ba Rai is female, and Esstrayan is male. Their narrative is one of the princess and her knight in shining armor. Its just that the genders are reversed, without altering the roles at all. So Esstrayan is a princess, and that means he likes to be called 'Lady' and wears ornate dresses, even though, for all intents and purposes, he's a he (well, as much as a Fae can have a gender).</div> </div> </div> </div>It seemed funny at the time...<br /> <br /> (The two are a pair that appeared in an old online game I STed for)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T21:49:43-08:00","id":59489,"title":"","content":"Ah lol... I thought they just had the gender roles backwards for all XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.th