:[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T17:50:18-07:00","id":89142,"title":"","content":"Oh... I thought it was just for you... nvm X","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T11:52:46-07:00","id":90362,"title":"","content":"Should I start sacrificing IC goats to bring our ST back, or do you think we should pull all the stops and go for cattle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T13:02:50-07:00","id":90394,"title":"","content":"After a three day ritual, I have sacrificed three aurochs and a yeddin to the majesty of the Dark Constellation of Ess'Tee, the Titan of Narrative Causality. Grant us your power, Ess-Tee that you may move along the plot!<br /> <br /> (I roll 7 successes on my prayer roll. Do I succeed?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T14:42:10-07:00","id":90425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=90394#post90394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After a three day ritual, I have sacrificed three aurochs and a yeddin to the majesty of the Dark Constellation of Ess'Tee, the Titan of Narrative Causality. Grant us your power, Ess-Tee that you may move along the plot!<br /> <br /> (I roll 7 successes on my prayer roll. Do I succeed?)</div> </div> </div> </div>What was the resource value of the sacrifices and are you a priest of Ess'Tee?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T14:46:42-07:00","id":90428,"title":"","content":"And Lo, doth a figure appear from the Firmament. A figure, pale and gaunt, with sunken eyes and stringy hair as dark as the blackness within his heart. <div align=\"center\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><i><b>1:</b><sup>1</sup>WHO DOTH DISTURB ME!<br /> HE WHO LORDS OVER THE TITANS,<br /> THAT WHICH ETCHES UPON THE SHINMA!</i><br /> <i><sup>2</sup>CREATION IS MY PLAYGROUND,<br /> AND THEION HIMSELF BOWED BEFORE ME<br /> <sup>3</sup>YOUR MEASLY BEINGS EXIST BECAUSE I ALLOW IT<br /> AND YOU WILL END WHEN I DEMA-<br /> <br /> <sup>4</sup>OH, IT IS YOU!<br /> YOU WHO BEG AND IMPLORE ME FOR MORE.<br /> I SHALL GRANT YOUR REQUEST.<br /> I SHALL 'MOVE THINGS ALONG'<br /> <br /> <b>2:</b><sup>1</sup>A HUNDRED HUNDRED YEARS HAVE PAST<br /> <sup>2</sup>THE CELESTINES OF THE SUN<br /> MOON<br /> JOURNEYS<br /> PEACE<br /> AND BATTLE HAVE FALLEN<br /> <sup>3</sup>THE TITANS OF MONARCHY<br /> ORDER<br /> DARKNESS<br /> WORD<br /> IGNITION </i></span></span><br /> <i><span style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">MACHINE </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">AND CONSUMPTION HAVE FALLEN.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><sup>4</sup>ALL AT THE HANDS OF THE MAD SUN-KINGS</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><sup>5</sup>ENRAGED UPON KNOWING THE TRUTH OF THE GREAT BETRAYAL</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">THEY SOUGHT TO DESTROY ALL WHO COULD THREATEN THEM</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><sup>6</sup>THE BLOOD OF THE DRAGONS HAS BEEN ALL BUT SPENT</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">THE MOON-BLESSED AND THE STAR-CHOSEN HIDE IN THE SHADOWS </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\">HOUNDED BY THE ENRAGED GOD-KINGS. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><sup>7</sup>THE NETHER-HELLS SWELL </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">WITH THE SOULS OF THE FALLEN</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><sup>8</sup>AND THE MAD LORDS OF THE DEAD WAGE WAR<br /> UPON THE INSANE PRINCES OF THE LIVING<br /> <br /> <b>3: </b><sup>1</sup>AMONG OUR HEROES, ALL REMAIN<br /> DESPITE THE RAVAGES OF TIME<br /> <br /> <sup>2</sup>THE HERALD OF PEACE HAS BEEN ENSLAVED<br /> AND CHAINED UPON THE MACHINA OF DESTINY<br /> <sup>3</sup>LITTLE DO HER CAPTORS KNOW<br /> HER WILL REMAINS UNBOWED<br /> UNBROKEN<br /> DESPITE AN AGE OF TORTURE<br /> <br /> <sup>4</sup>THE SUN-CRAFTER<br /> UNWILLING TO JOIN THE RAMPAGE OF HIS KIN<br /> WAS CAUGHT AN TORTURED BY HIS FELLOWS<br /> <sup>5</sup>SOUL-FLESH OF THE DEAD MACHINE-TITAN<br /> WAS GRAFTED TO HIS MIND AND SOUL<br /> TURNING HIM INTO A MONSTER<br /> <sup>6</sup>NOW \u200bOBSESSED WITH MAKING THE WEAPONS<br /> FOUND IN HIS NIGHTMARES<br /> INTO REALITY<br /> <br /> <sup>7</sup>THE SUN-HERALD<br /> JOINED HIS DRAGON-KIN<br /> AND LED A MIGHTY ARMY IN BATTLE<br /> <sup>8</sup>HIS LEGION FELL<br /> BUT HE REMAINS<br /> <sup>9</sup>UNDER-WORLD<br /> \u200bMARSHALING HIS TROOPS FOR THE FINAL WAR<br /> <br /> <sup>10</sup>AND THE MOON-LADY<br /> CAUGHT<br /> TORTURED<br /> ESCAPED<br /> <sup>11</sup>HUNTED AND HUNTING<br /> WITH HER COMPANION<br /> <sup>12</sup>THE IMPOSSIBLE MAN<br /> <br /> <b>4: </b><sup>1</sup>VERY WELL<br /> WHAT SHALL YOU DO?</span></span></i></div> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T15:01:20-07:00","id":90436,"title":"","content":"@Exthalion: No, I'm not, and I'm pretty sure that the resources of the animals I sacrificed would be about resources 4. if, it wasn't for the fact that I skimped on a healthy auroch for a cheap one, and the yeddin was stolen from that famous racing hero, Cathak Mario Andretti.<br /> <br /> @Ess'Tee: I'mma go play Nobilis. Noble of Potatoes, here I come! /sarcasm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T17:31:38-07:00","id":90519,"title":"","content":"How many days will it take to travel? And have we earned more experience or do we still just have 5?<br /> <br /> Oh... and I guess I'll start worshiping other gods <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","user":"CitanHyuga","date":".  Cause 03-13-2014, 08:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T19:13:18-07:00","id":90564,"title":"","content":"What is the approximate magnitude of Grey Ice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T19:14:48-07:00","id":90567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CitanHyuga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=90519#post90519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How many days will it take to travel? And have we earned more experience or do we still just have 5?<br /> <br /> Oh... and I guess I'll start worshiping other gods <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, I dun goofed. The post has been edited, but for the record, its two days travel. <br /> <br /> Now would be a good time to add more exp, huh? We'll call that the end of &quot;Session 2&quot;, so y'all get +5 exp, on top of what you had, +1 for each confirmed 3-die Stunt. I'll look up the exact numbers for everyone in a bit. Exthalion, Yi can get exp as if in the 'first session', to maintain party exp parity. <br /> <br /> I regards to your final comment: I would have figured that you'd want Hyuga to be turned into a quasi-divine cyborg by having bits and pieces of a mechanical over-god grafted to his body and soul. I suppose I'm going to have to scrap that plot arc now. Scheisse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T20:56:52-07:00","id":90614,"title":"","content":"Damn! I'm only good at getting possible 2-die stunts... lol. Guess I'll have to work better on that :/<br /> <br /> I don't need to become autochthon... ive got more fun plans...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T22:39:40-07:00","id":90672,"title":"","content":"Hyuga, learning Protection of Celestial Bliss takes 3 days if you have a tutor. Without it takes six.<br /> <br /> I am willing to swap mentoring though, PoCB for CNNT?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T06:28:42-07:00","id":90851,"title":"","content":"Of course! I can help you learn any charm I know anytime. Sounds good!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T14:56:50-07:00","id":91118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=90564#post90564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the approximate magnitude of Grey Ice?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's around the middle of Magnitude 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:08:35-07:00","id":91126,"title":"","content":"Oh, this will be easy then. I am going to be popping off Wise-Eyed Courtier Technique to turn the enthusiasm I created into a general behavior.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T13:00:42-07:00","id":94400,"title":"","content":"Excellent RPing, Exthalion, Hyuga.<br /> <br /> I'll move things along in bit, to give everyone else one last chance to chime in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T09:10:37-07:00","id":95682,"title":"","content":"Does Tirien have a lot of experience with live and angry seafood?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T13:29:11-07:00","id":95916,"title":"","content":"Tirien, as a Dynastic scion, has had her fair share of seafood, both living and dead. However, she never really took to the singing and dancing crabs. Their ditties about living under the sea struck a little too close to cannibalism for her tastes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T15:36:31-07:00","id":95997,"title":"","content":"Interesting. Is that why she identified the oyster fork as the stabbing fork?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T16:06:54-07:00","id":96024,"title":"","content":"Well, the stronger tines make it easier for the oyster fork to deal damage...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T15:03:59-07:00","id":101507,"title":"","content":"Okay, to make my plan more explicit:<br /> <br /> I don't know if we are going to actually use the mass combat rules, but Thaumturgical wards raise a units Might by 1. Mortal armies have Might 0 by default, and Might 1 is the level of god-blooded or Mountain Folk warriors.<br /> <br /> The church, combined with my own wide scale magic should be enough to pump up the morale as well.<br /> <br /> Tirien should probably act as General or some sort of special forces commander given that she actually has War.<br /> <br /> These things added together, along with the Drill boost from having the experienced troops reinforce the levies should be enough to bring our armed forces to reasonable parity with the Fair Folk.<br /> <br /> Young Fair Folk Nobles are are Might 2, so the mostly commoner and goblin forces should be Might 1 and the Drill of same will be terrible.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: @Noodle<br /> I was trying in my post to move things along so you didn't have to make separate posts that amounted to &quot;you arrive, read Hyugga's description&quot;. If you want something to happen I will edit it out. Also, if you would prefer I not do this sort of thing in the future please let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-30-2014, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T15:13:52-07:00","id":102963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=101507#post101507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, to make my plan more explicit:<br /> <br /> I don't know if we are going to actually use the mass combat rules, but Thaumturgical wards raise a units Might by 1. Mortal armies have Might 0 by default, and Might 1 is the level of god-blooded or Mountain Folk warriors.<br /> <br /> The church, combined with my own wide scale magic should be enough to pump up the morale as well.<br /> <br /> Tirien should probably act as General or some sort of special forces commander given that she actually has War.<br /> <br /> These things added together, along with the Drill boost from having the experienced troops reinforce the levies should be enough to bring our armed forces to reasonable parity with the Fair Folk.<br /> <br /> Young Fair Folk Nobles are are Might 2, so the mostly commoner and goblin forces should be Might 1 and the Drill of same will be terrible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems like a pretty smart idea, given the information you currently have on the enemy forces.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\