roove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Experience Gained: </b>49<br /> <b>Experience Spent: </b>47<br /> Friendship with Animals Approach = 10<br /> Craft (Fire) Specialty Crafting Armor from +2 to +3 = 3<br /> Lore from 1 to 2 = 2<br /> Strength from 3 to 4 = 12<br /> Willpower from 5 to 6 = 10<br /> Bulwark Stance = 8<br /> Survival from 1 to 2 = 2<br /> <b>Experience Left: </b>2</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <u><b>History</b></u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jensven was born in a small Northeastern tribal community of raiders that would sail waterways in order to plunder neighboring tribes. Instead of growing to be a raider, he became apprenticed to the tribe's blacksmith, who taught him the secrets of crafting armor and blades. One day while the raiders were out reaving the tribe was attacked and Jensven found himself needing to protect the women and children with nothing but a hastily grabbed shield and his smith's hammer.<br /> <br /> He was beaten, bloody, and wounded. He was on the verge of giving up when he decided that he needed to try one last time to at least take one of the invaders out with him. It was then that the Unconquered Sun chose him to be a warrior and guardian in his name. His mentor was killed in the attack, but the reavers arrived in time to help drive off their enemies.<br /> <br /> The newly exalted Lawgiver left searching for meaning in the world. He was able to connect with a Guild Caravan headed for the Hundred Kingdoms and offer them his services as a smith as payment for his passage with them.<br /> <br /> He arrived in the Novalesk region with the caravan and upon hearing the rumors of a battle brewing, decided to see what could be done to help drive away the Fair Ones. His only companions are his sword, a chain shirt, and Shadow, his dog that seems to have developed an even closer bond to him since he became Chosen of the Sun.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I will provide information concerning his combat capabilities and equipment later. Please let me know if I need to make any adjustments and if my math is good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 03-01-2015, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T17:33:25-07:00","id":128637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128539#post128539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ordon is someone's project, and possibly has a connection to the Mountain Folk. Or a factory ruin of some sort. Heck, with our luck its where the Seal of Eight Divinities was broken and the armies of Sova are coming.</div> </div> </div> </div>Newb questions here...Seal of Eight Divinities? Sova? What the howl are you talking about, Bro?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T17:44:59-07:00","id":128647,"title":"","content":"<b>-Theros-</b><br /> Theros lies to the west of Novalesk. The people of this nation are rather similar to those of Novalesk in type and disposition. Theros, however, is a highly Immaculate nation, which has caused a great deal of friction between the two nations over the centuries. In RY 528, Theros became a Realm tributary following a losing successive wars with Ordon and Novalesk.<br /> <br /> Theros is an Absolute Monarchy with absolute primogeniture succession (oldest child inherits, regardless of sex), though a non-exalted inheritor will often give up the succession in favor their closest Exalted relative (a survival trait due to the two-week life expectancy of non-exalted monarchs). The nation has always been blessed with a small number of Terrestrial Exalted, dating back to its inception. There are a number of noble houses with strong Terrestrial bloodlines, but none with long history. Weaker families are absorbed into the stronger ones with alarming frequency, though once a family reaches a certain critical mass it fractures into multiple smaller ones to repeat the cycle.<br /> <br /> Theros has a citizen military, such as it is. Native Therian males are expected to own a shield, spear and linen curiass, and keep them in repair. Their forces are, generally speaking, poorly equipped and untrained. The noble houses each maintain a private military force, modeled on Realm legion forces. The Realm Garrison is composed of two Wings detached from the 19th Imperial Legion. Together, these forces provide a professional core for the untrained levies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T17:51:09-07:00","id":128652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128539#post128539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Geherin is a Lunar Thousand Streams River Project, possibly in their origins and definitely now.<br /> <br /> Ordon is someone's project, and possibly has a connection to the Mountain Folk. Or a factory ruin of some sort. Heck, with our luck its where the Seal of Eight Divinities was broken and the armies of Sova are coming.</div> </div> </div> </div>(1) You said it, not me. Though I will say for the record that IF there's a Lunar running its NOT the Silver Horned Mother<br /> <br /> (2) That is a distinct possibility! <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128548#post128548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Character Sheet</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bLooks good. I'll have to go over the math later, but you can get the EXP for the previous &quot;sessions&quot; to maintain parity, which is 14 if my records are correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T17:59:10-07:00","id":128656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128637#post128637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Newb questions here...Seal of Eight Divinities? Sova? What the howl are you talking about, Bro?</div> </div> </div> </div>Seal of Eight Divinities is the Dimensional Seal between Autochthonia (Autochthon's world-body where the Alchemical Exalts are) and Creation. It's been closed since the early first age, and is nigh impenetrable from Creation-side. It's just difficult to open from the other.<br /> <br /> Sova is the most militaristic of the eight nations in Autochthonia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T18:01:28-07:00","id":128657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128637#post128637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Newb questions here...Seal of Eight Divinities? Sova? What the howl are you talking about, Bro?</div> </div> </div> </div>The seal of eight divinities is what keeps autochthonia from being accessible from creation and vice versa. If it is broken, then travel between both places would be possible. SOVA is a part of a gameplay version of that where atuochthonia comes back into creation, if I am not mistaken. The army would probably be jadeborn or other alchemicals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T18:02:03-07:00","id":128661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128637#post128637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Newb questions here...Seal of Eight Divinities? Sova? What the howl are you talking about, Bro?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Machine-Titan Autocthon once once a close ally of the Incarna (The highest and most powerful gods and rulers of Heaven) and assisted them in creating the Exalted. However, he came to fear the power and madness of the Solars and fled along with his mortal followers into Elsewhere (hard to explain, but essentially the place things are sent by hammerspace magic). The Seal of Eight Divinities is the magic ward he raised to prevent anyone from following him. Sova is one of the eight human nations that developed in his world-body and is among the most militaristic of the eight. <br /> <br /> There is a lot more to it, but in this context the reference was a joke that basically meant, &quot;Noodle is trying to kill us.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128652#post128652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> (1) You said it, not me. Though I will say for the record that IF there's a Lunar running its NOT the Silver Horned Mother<br /> <br /> (2) That is a distinct possibility!</div> </div> </div> </div>(1) Of course not, the Mother is obviously the figurehead set up to keep the thing going while the Elder attended to other projects. It is also a convenient role to step into if the Elder wants more direct control or to integrate students into the existing culture.<br /> <br /> (2) I call dibs on &quot;My Pet Robot&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T18:12:08-07:00","id":128665,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answers guys! I knew the Seal of Eight Divinities sounded familiar. I'm not too versed with Alchemicals or Autochthon, though.<br /> <br /> I, for one, don't think Noodle is trying to kill us. Give us one heck of a scare? Sure. Make us cry like momma's boys? You bet your Manse. Kill us? Where is the fun in that, I ask you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T18:16:20-07:00","id":128667,"title":"","content":"Well there is always the fun of looking like an evil dictator who teaches &quot;life lessons&quot; and make you reroll... but knowing him, we will be FAIRLY safe (I did nearly die in one of his games... (stupid evil, meniacal blade) I was acting in character, but it WAS stupid to pick up that blade in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T18:42:43-07:00","id":128681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128665#post128665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I, for one, don't think Noodle is trying to kill us. Give us one heck of a scare? Sure. Make us cry like momma's boys? You bet your Manse. Kill us? Where is the fun in that, I ask you?</div> </div> </div> </div>No matter how I try to reassure you guys this will happen:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0p