div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Although the two PKs I did were because I didn't quite understand the Akuma rules such as they were, and the other only NEAR PK moment was caused by Hyuga's Solar doing some incredibly stupid in-character actions.<br /> <br /> &quot;This statue. In this tower. In this hill of skulls. In the Underworld. Yes, we should move it. Wait, what do you mean it was actually a <i>SARCOPHAGUS</i>?&quot;<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T21:53:38-07:00","id":128746,"title":"","content":"Hey! If I hadn't broken it in the roll, we could have done AWESOME things with that. Just because we are in the underworld doesn't mean we shouldn't explore... that is how we got the powers of necromancy anyway. I might've even learned a new spell!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T04:12:06-07:00","id":128863,"title":"","content":"So, I could jump in at a few places in my mind. Jensven would have armor-smithing on the mind. He could definitely do this in Ordon, but Geherin would seem closer to home. It wouldn't be exactly like home, but that is academic. He would avoid Theros if at all possible. There is also the option of showing up near the front lines as he would believe he could do the most good there, trying to craft/repair armor for the guys actually doing the fighting. The capitol of Novalesk is another definite possibility as the most talented smiths of the nation would naturally be there, in his opinion.<br /> <br /> So, let me list these options <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Showing up in Geherin as that is somewhat familiar with it's warlike, tribal culture</li> <li>Spending time in Ordon as that would provide the best smithing opportunities</li> <li>Heading to the front so he could directly help the combatants</li> <li>Stopping in Novalesk to try and coordinate with established smiths</li> </ol><br /> I am also open to suggestions. This guy is REALLY new to the whole exaltation thing. He knows only about what he can obviously do, what the Unconquered Sun showed him at exaltation, and what legends he has heard. He is still thinking in the terms that he is an apprentice armor-smith and trying to reconcile the fact that his motivation is no longer to just craft good armor, but to be the best freakin' guardian he can be. The journey of him changing his mind (his heart already has) and his perspective should be interesting to play out.<br /> <br /> Long story short, where would you guys like to see him?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T10:55:42-07:00","id":129097,"title":"","content":"Okay<br /> <br /> (1) is applicable, and seems like a nice place to move in. <br /> (2) Eh... The Ordon are highly xeonphobic. Won't fly.<br /> (3) Would fly, but I would much prefer you to end up in contact with another PC soon-ish.<br /> (4) That would likely be best, since then it could get Hyuga's attention and then you two could go on awesome SWORD MAKIN' SWORD KILLIN' adventures. <br /> <br /> So, (1) and (4) would seem best to me. Nut hey, If you want to fight on the front lines as a merc, I can do that too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T11:07:25-07:00","id":129101,"title":"","content":"Oooh. Ooooh. I got it. Yeah. This is gonna be goooood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T12:52:48-07:00","id":129198,"title":"","content":"Noodle, are you suggesting I begin hiring my own assasins to kill the Dawn before these fools give my kingdom to someone else after all my hard work? (Also, I think I am two days ahead of Tirien and one ahead of Hyuga time wise. Which should give me plenty of time to layer on the social magic.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T13:31:35-07:00","id":129228,"title":"","content":"They can try to give the Dawn the kingdom, but he would most likely refuse. He is still very much under the impression that he is the apprentice blacksmith to a tribe of naval raiding barbarians.<br /> <br /> On a more positive note, I believe I will start in the capital and start doing things there. He doesn't yet realize that he is going to be able to turn into a combat monster and will go with what is comfortable for him; making exceptional armor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T13:52:10-07:00","id":129240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129198#post129198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Noodle, are you suggesting I begin hiring my own assasins to kill the Dawn before these fools give my kingdom to someone else after all my hard work? (Also, I think I am two days ahead of Tirien and one ahead of Hyuga time wise. Which should give me plenty of time to layer on the social magic.)</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bYou're two days ahead of Tirien, and on the same day as Hyuga. Unless CitanHyuga tells me otherwise, I will assume the 'night' he was talking 'bout is the same one that you crashed at Larissa's place. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129228#post129228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a more positive note, I believe I will start in the capital and start doing things there. He doesn't yet realize that he is going to be able to turn into a combat monster and will go with what is comfortable for him; making exceptional armor.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there goes my whole UCS pulls a &quot;YHWH vs Israel MMA match&quot; idea to throw you towards the rest of the Circle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:07:40-07:00","id":129249,"title":"","content":"Roleplaying 101: ALWAYS throw wrenches into the ST's plot. Actually, it was just me doing the unexpected. However, didn't you tell me that was the best option?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:12:29-07:00","id":129252,"title":"","content":"Yes, yes I did. I should have learned from Hyuga and Dietaku to never plan for anything longer than the next time the player get input.<br /> <br /> Just my pointing out that you missed an opportunity for Divine Right to kick ass. Well, more than you already have, being a Dawn caste and all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:46:47-07:00","id":129271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=125524#post125524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A note: Anything I post here about setting material (Such as the above profiles) is not necessarily fact. It is information that I feel your characters would be able to parse out given your resources and contacts (At this point, mostly Dero and random people on the streets). While information on the Gentes and Novalesk are generally reliable, information of the neighboring nations will largely be vague and mutually contradictory.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bYou'll note that despite this, the profiles for Ordon, Theros and Geherin are merely vague. This is because I decided to put the 'hard' facts into the profiles and leave the Rumors to the <b>Rumor Mill</b>. Basically, whenever I get bored I'll come up with a bunch of rumors, of the kinds you might find in tabloids or conspiracy theories, and post them up here! For extra fun <b>at least one of the rumors in each Rumor Mill post is true</b>. Have fun with the guessing!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:50:14-07:00","id":129273,"title":"","content":"<b>The Rumor Mill Turns for the first time! </b><br /> <br /> This post's subject is <b>Novalesk</b>!<br /> <br /> -Gens Spyrus secretly worships an entity known as the &quot;Chariot of Embers&quot;.<br /> <br /> -Gens Midea has a covert group of shape-shifting assassins all descended from the &quot;True Midea Bloodline&quot;.<br /> <br /> -Chancellor Feiro occasionally sacrifices troublesome students to a giant crystalline fire-ball.<br /> <br /> -Origenes is actually an Anathema.<br /> <br /> -Origenon Larissa has an Anathema lover.<br /> <br /> -The Guild secretly controls Gens Nikoloi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:51:37-07:00","id":129274,"title":"","content":"<b>Rumor Mill #2!</b><br /> <br /> Subject is the <b>Geherin</b>!<br /> <br /> -Horses have the same civil rights as humans in Geherin.<br /> <br /> -The Geherin are a species of sentient, bipedal plant.<br /> <br /> -The Geherin are an advanced species of ape that wear human suits to make them feel like people.<br /> <br /> -The Geherin are secretly run by a Lunar Anathema.<br /> <br /> -Geherin Skalds have long-lost magics that uproot trees and make them fight alongside their warriors.<br /> <br /> - The Geherin use ancient blood-magic to transform their foes into trees. This is how they grow their forests.<br /> <br /> - The Geherin are run by a troupe of Raksha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-14-2014, 01:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:53:55-07:00","id":129276,"title":"","content":"<b>Rumor Mill 3! For the Glory of Ordon</b><br /> <br /> -Ordon's leadership caste is comprised of a group of quasi-divine Jade statues. These beings lead the Ordoni in the worship of a mechanical god run by smoke and clockwork.<br /> <br /> -Ordon sits upon a portal to an alien world of darkness and metal. A Realm of Brass and Shadows, if you will.<br /> <br /> -Ordon is a Lookshan puppet-state.<br /> <br /> -All residents of Ordon have their brain removed and replaced with a machine when they reach adulthood.<br /> <br /> -Ordoni are not born, they're grown.<br /> <br /> -The Ordon have dug too greedily and too deep. In so doing, they've released something dark and evil.<br /> <br /> -Ordon is built atop a military facility constructed as a fallout bunker by a paranoid Anathema god-king in the Age of Glories.<br /> <br /> -The Ordon build clockwork men and use them as warriors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T14:56:44-07:00","id":129281,"title":"","content":"<b>Rumor Mill #4!<br /> <br /> Subject is Theros</b><br /> <br /> -The Realm uses Theros as a dumping ground for illegitimate yet unexalted children.<br /> <br /> -Theros' actual king is an ancient bird-man swordsman who lives in a nearby shadowland.<br /> <br /> -Theros is bent on conquering the surrounding Nations as part of an elaborate plot to encircle Nasaru and Gunzota Redoubts.<br /> <br /> -King Urlik of Theros has been possessed by the baleful spirit of his black blade.<br /> <br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Black Cowl', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> <br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Gilded Triangle', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> <br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Haired Beast', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:11:01-07:00","id":129287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129273#post129273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Origenon Larissa has an Anathema lover.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this isn't the true one, it will be in a reasonably brief span of time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129240#post129240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bYou're two days ahead of Tirien, and on the same day as Hyuga. Unless CitanHyuga tells me otherwise, I will assume the 'night' he was talking 'bout is the same one that you crashed at Larissa's place.</div> </div> </div> </div>I take it the lack of a negative means I should indeed start hiring assassins. Oh well, you can never have too many assassins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-09-2014, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:15:47-07:00","id":129290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\">