v class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129276#post129276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-The Ordon have dug too greedily and too deep. In so doing, they've released something dark and evil.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would be totally stoked if this one was true. Have a group of Mountain Folk that founded Ordon be the ones that did the digging and then, BOOM! They no longer exist. Yeeeeaaaahhhh, that would be flippin' sweet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:19:34-07:00","id":129367,"title":"","content":"A lot of focus on the Ordon, which is natural considering how secretive they are. I would like to see what your predictions for the true one(s) for all of the posts are, just for the record.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:29:45-07:00","id":129381,"title":"","content":"My guesses for the true rumors;<br /> <br /> -Origenes is actually an Anathema.<br /> -Origenon Larissa has an Anathema lover.<br /> - The Geherin are run by a troupe of Raksha.<br /> - Ordon is a Lookshan puppet-state.<br /> -Ordon is built atop a military facility constructed as a fallout bunker by a paranoid Anathema god-king in the Age of Glories.<br /> -The Realm uses Theros as a dumping ground for illegitimate yet unexalted children.<br /> -Theros is bent on conquering the surrounding Nations as part of an elaborate plot to encircle Nasaru and Gunzota Redoubts.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:31:16-07:00","id":129384,"title":"","content":"I would have believed the they dug to deep and released something... and it does mention that in the books that there are sealed prisons underground that hold the most detestable creatures and gods, but that seems way too easy....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:32:36-07:00","id":129386,"title":"","content":"Oh, yes, I've forgotten about this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=128661#post128661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(1) Of course not, the Mother is obviously the figurehead set up to keep the thing going while the Elder attended to other projects. It is also a convenient role to step into if the Elder wants more direct control or to integrate students into the existing culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Silver-Horned Mother resents accusations of patsy-ness from Origenes' most recent toadie. She says the only reason she's not eating you is because Origenes called and asked her not to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:50:37-07:00","id":129399,"title":"","content":"Let's see...<br /> -Illegitimate yet unexalted children of the Realm in Theros? I'll buy that.<br /> -Gens Nikoloi secretly run by the Guild? Why not.<br /> -While I want Ordon to have dug too deep, I don't think that is the safest bet. I will go with the clockwork men. That would explain why all that material isn't exported.<br /> -Geherin is run by a Lunar? You darn betcha. Thousand Streams River for the win.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:16:27-07:00","id":129464,"title":"","content":"I apologize if this recent turn of evens seems contrived. I just trying to get Jensven together with one of the established circle members ASAP, and it seemed to be the best way to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:35:08-07:00","id":129476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129273#post129273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Origenon Larissa has an Anathema lover.</div> </div> </div> </div>Someone could have checked up on me and put together that Origenes is away, so I spent the night with the goddess. If they know I am an Anathema it raises odd questions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129274#post129274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-The Geherin are secretly run by a Lunar Anathema.</div> </div> </div> </div>We have discussed this and I feel fairly confident.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129276#post129276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Ordon is built atop a military facility constructed as a fallout bunker by a paranoid Anathema god-king in the Age of Glories.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Jadeborn are forbidden by the Geas from ruling over humans so the first is likely untrue and if the seal had been broken long enough for that society to develop the effect would have been greater.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129281#post129281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- An Anathema cult, known as the 'Black Cowl', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> <br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Gilded Triangle', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> <br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Haired Beast', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>The encirclement thing doesn't make much sense because Lookshy could withdraw if need be and put a redoubt elsewhere. These three are all the same rumor with different anathema rulers, Abyssal, Solar, and Lunar respectively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:52:03-07:00","id":129487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129464#post129464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I apologize if this recent turn of evens seems contrived. I just trying to get Jensven together with one of the established circle members ASAP, and it seemed to be the best way to do so.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's alright. Unconquered Sun messing with his peeps to make sure they do what he wants is what I would chalk it up to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:54:27-07:00","id":129491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129476#post129476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone could have checked up on me and put together that Origenes is away, so I spent the night with the goddess. If they know I am an Anathema it raises odd questions.</div> </div> </div> </div>When I say one is true, I mean that it's true, not that it's just supported by factual evidence. If this is the true rumor, it would mean that Larissa is doing the dirty deed with an Anathema, and since Yi and Larissa hasn't done it as of present, he's ruled out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129476#post129476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The encirclement thing doesn't make much sense because Lookshy could withdraw if need be and put a redoubt elsewhere. These three are all the same rumor with different anathema rulers, Abyssal, Solar, and Lunar respectively.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps getting Lookshy to withdraw and put their redoubts elsewhere IS the objective. From a long term perspective, it is infinitely better to win a war without fighting than not. Getting Lookshy to retreat would allow the Realm influence from Theros and Greyfalls to expand into the rest of the Hundred Kingdoms, squeezing the Confederation of Rivers between it and the Realm proper.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T18:57:04-07:00","id":129495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129487#post129487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's alright. Unconquered Sun messing with his peeps to make sure they do what he wants is what I would chalk it up to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sunbeams and Mice. Sunbeams and...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Glories of the Most High: Sol</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The mice of the sun are small, pure-white white field mice bearing a golden sunburst pat- tern upon their fur. They have the traits of normal field mice, save that they have Intelligence 4. When sent out by the Unconquered Sun to assist the righteous, the mice have chewed through the bonds of the imprisoned, eaten the bowstrings of encroaching armies, ruined the beautiful possessions of the wealthy and wicked. They have even spread the Plague of the Sun in the direst of circumstances.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I was going for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:01:27-07:00","id":129499,"title":"","content":"I shall never forget the help that the UcS's mice give. It saved me and my companions (thought it DID end up killing my son.... stupid holy nuke) :/ My son never got to be the hero that Malfeas needed...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T20:16:42-07:00","id":129560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129491#post129491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> When I say one is true, I mean that it's true, not that it's just supported by factual evidence. If this is the true rumor, it would mean that Larissa is doing the dirty deed with an Anathema, and since Yi and Larissa hasn't done it as of present, he's ruled out.<br /> <br /> Perhaps getting Lookshy to withdraw and put their redoubts elsewhere IS the objective. From a long term perspective, it is infinitely better to win a war without fighting than not. Getting Lookshy to retreat would allow the Realm influence from Theros and Greyfalls to expand into the rest of the Hundred Kingdoms, squeezing the Confederation of Rivers between it and the Realm proper.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, now that changes things. In addition to the true rumors are there, not true but available evidence does strongly support? That will make it harder to ferret out the true ones since the rest aren't just baseless heresay.<br /> <br /> Add &quot;Rough map of political influence in the East&quot; to the list of things I humbly request.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T21:24:54-07:00","id":129600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129560#post129560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, now that changes things. In addition to the true rumors are there, not true but available evidence does strongly support? That will make it harder to ferret out the true ones since the rest aren't just baseless heresay.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not necessarily 'strongly support' but the rumors have to come from somewhere. Any Novaleski merchant worth his salt will tell you that the Geherin get pissed if they see you using horses as draft animals, so you've got to use oxen. The King of Theros has a black blade, and sometimes speaks of it like it's both alive and wicked. There are folk-tales of subterranean Jade Men who worship a clockwork god and have supernal proficiency with technology; at the same time, the Ordon have advanced technology that seems to appear out of thin air.<br /> <br /> In reference to that particular rumor, Larissa may have a lover, and they are suspected of being an Anathema. Or, she just disappears regularly, and people started wondering why. Someone got it in their head that she's having an affair, and then that evolved into her having an affair with an Anathema.<br /> <br /> Long story short; all of the rumors will have some sort of 'evidence' even if it's conspiracy theory level nonsense, since the rumors <i>have to</i> <i>start from somewhere</i>. In each of the sets, at least one of them is factually correct, either due to someone in the know blabbing, some investigator/academic putting things together, or random dumb luck.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129560#post129560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Add &quot;Rough map of political influence in the East&quot; to the list of things I humbly request.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll get on it. It may take a while though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-10-2014, 12:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T22:03:46-07:00","id":129620,"title":"","content":"Good grief, this is what I get for going to work without an internet connection all day. I won't say anything, though, about the rumors, as I know too much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T17:05:54-07:00","id":134689,"title":"","content":"Okay, as I'm gearing up for a second round of the <b>Rumor Mill</b>, I'd like to ask y'all how you want it delivered in the future. There are three ways I can do it:<br /> <br /> (1) Post an update every three or four days for all polities, much like the initial run. <br /> (2) Post an update for one polity each day, cycling through them.<br /> (3) Post an update for each polity once I deem it robust enough. This will result in something of a middle line for the two, but may result in over-exposure for certain polities. <br /> <br /> Personally, I think option (2) would be best, but since the whole reason for me doing this is to keep interest in the game up (and to help me exercise my creative muscles), I want to give you guys a vote.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T17:13:32-07:00","id":134700,"title":"","content":"Um... quick question, Belkra: What material are Jensven's sword and armor made of? I could see them being bronze, iron or steel, but don't want to assume either of them. This is suddenly important for reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:01:08-07:00","id":134723,"title":"","content":"If he is a mortal using anything like medieval technology it will have both iron and steel in it, often in the same piece of metal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:35:41-07:00","id":134745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=134723#post134723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If he is a mortal using anything like medieval technology it will have both iron and steel in it, often in the same piece of metal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probable, though from alchemical purposes that would be &quot;steel&quot;. Bronze is also has a significant probability, especially in places like Novalesk that have significant iron deficiencies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:45:40-07:00","id":134753,"title":"","content":"As an aside, I just read a discussion of cold iron and thought it funny how different the gaming conception of it was from the ancient one. For a lot of purposes it was just a euphemism like &quot;hot lead&quot; or referred to wrought iron which is definitely hot at some point. Oh well.<br /> <br /> How did Novalesk get lucky enough to get both copper and tin mines? They tend to be found in different places. Then again, Creation is an infinitely thick disk floating on an ocean of impossibility where earth elementals literally grow metals and gems with magic and nothing like plate tectonics exists except very close to the Poles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T18:57:38-07:00","id":134768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=134753#post134753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As an aside, I just read a discussion of cold iron and thought it funny how different the gaming conception of it was from the ancient one. For a lot of purposes it was just a euphemism like &quot;hot lead&quot; or referred to wrought iron which is definitely hot at some point. Oh well.<br /> <br /> How did Novalesk get lucky enough to get both copper and tin mines? They tend to be found in different places. Then again, Creation is an infinitely thick disk floating on an ocean of impossibility where earth elementals literally grow metals and gems with magic and nothing like plate tectonics exists except very close to the Poles.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, in Creation, metaphysically, &quot;Cold Iron&quot; as in the Iron that fucks over Fae, is iron without any alchemical processes done on it; tempering the iron to steel counts as an alchemical process, so... yeah. <br /> <br /> Really they only have Copper Mines in the foothills in the North. The Tin deposits are found along the rivers washed downstream from primary lodes. This is actually a quite common method of obtaining Tin, and is totally not me just checking wikipedia to find a somewhat plausible explaination for something I hadn't considered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T19:57:22-07:00","id":134855,"title":"","content":"Alright I have three characters to submit Noodle, I will let the players decide which one they would prefer to have in play with them<br /> <br /> 1. Vykos Antalek (Twilight) an Investigator, Doctor, Geneticist (Craft: Genesis) and a sorcerer not to interested in politic put he see the fair folks attack as a good opportunity to test his skills (Anyone want super soldiers ? or demon back up)<br /> 2. Valerion The Devil Tiger (Dawn) Martial Artist in the White Reaper Style here to test his skills against the fairfolk after a bet with his lunar mate (not present)<br /> 3. Akteus (Dawn) Front line Leader with war charms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T20:11:24-07:00","id":134895,"title":"","content":"Hmm, on the one hand dumb muscle is much easier to manipulate for my own ends. On the other hand, competent underlings are more useful in the long run. Decisions decisions.<br /> <br /> Kidding aside, do any interest you more than the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T20:34:49-07:00","id":134940,"title":"","content":"From my perspective, Number (1) is most dissimilar from the other PCs (and therefore least likely to step on the others' toes), but do whichever you feel like, my friend.<br /> <br /> While I'm remembering:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=134689#post134689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, as I'm gearing up for a second round of the <b>Rumor Mill</b>, I'd like to ask y'all how you want it delivered in the future. There are three ways I can do it:<br /> <br /> (1) Post an update every three or four days for all polities, much like the initial run.<br /> (2) Post an update for one polity each day, cycling through them.<br /> (3) Post an update for each polity once I deem it robust enough. This will result in something of a middle line for the two, but may result in over-exposure for certain polities.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think option (2) would be best, but since the whole reason for me doing this is to keep interest in the game up (and to help me exercise my creative muscles), I want to give you guys a vote.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-12-2014, 11:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T20:50:13-07:00","id":134957,"title":"","content":"@Magnusar: I think the Twilight is more interesting, truth be told, and I can already see his interactions between Hyuga and himself being hilarious, as Hyuga is more an engineer, while your guy seems more like an out and out mad scientist.<br /> <br /> @Noodle: I agree, as it allows for more coherent focus on one nation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:00:40-07:00","id":134979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=134940#post134940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From my perspective, Number (1) is most dissimilar from the other PCs (and therefore least likely to step on the others' toes), but do whichever you feel like, my friend.<br /> <br /> While I'm remembering:<br /> <br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>I vote 2, I like updates frequently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:09:38-07:00","id":134984,"title":"","content":"I have no idea why this thing didn't update for me sooner. I will have to be more paranoid about not getting updates on the threads...I was literally checking in on this forum all day and only saw anything right now.<br /> <br /> @Noodle: Jensven is using steel. It wasn't exactly common where he was from, but being the guy that is going to replace the current blacksmith had it's perks. Even were it just plain old iron, he would have worked it and tempered it to make it more durable. That goes double for the armor.<br /> <br /> I would like to vote for you to only release the Rumor Mill updates when they are robust enough to be released. If this means we get fewer updates, but better quality ones, I'm all about it.<br /> <br /> @Magnusaur: Neither of the two proposed Dawns would step on my toes at all. I do think the Twilight would be neat, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:29:06-07:00","id":134992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=134984#post134984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to vote for you to only release the Rumor Mill updates when they are robust enough to be released. If this means we get fewer updates, but better quality ones, I'm all about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWell, I'll be working with all of them simultaneously, regardless of the choice. So their frequency would largely depend on when I can get brainstorming sessions, and that would mean that they would come in lumps of two or three polities at a time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T21:33:00-07:00","id":134995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 