le=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>And addiction to it has no downsides when you already suffer from freaky hallucinations from Abyssal Experiments+Charms and Wyld exposure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T19:07:24-07:00","id":136069,"title":"","content":"Exactly! If you already hallucinate.. I mean why not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T19:31:30-07:00","id":136081,"title":"","content":"My concern is that I have passed through my whole copy of the rule book and didn't found anything that deal with how many spell you begin with, do they count as charm or ? and the reason I'm asking is because My IRL ST gave me Intel x Occult spell with my starting character but I doubt that is standard <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-n