o say his anima looks like DNA than to say &quot;It looks like a Double-Helix with occasionally separates into two distinct legs&quot;. Linguistic shorthand is cool, at least when on the outside looking in.<br /> <br /> As for the Academy; it is primarily a school based around the teaching of Thaumaturgy; it has relatively few tomes on sorcery in general, and they are all built around the Emerald Circle. I suppose additional information is in order, and will come in a day or two, but to put it bluntly: Pretty much all of the information that the Academy has on bio-genesis is the occasional crystal of Dragon-King vegetative science. Not saying that this wouldn't open the eyes of a bright eccentric student to the possibilities of extending these principles to animals, but you wouldn't have any hard info. Yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T20:46:49-07:00","id":142045,"title":"","content":"So some rediscovery is in order, cool as long as it's doable I don't have a problem with it, so tell what I have to change on the character and I'll do it and as for the background story it could take a day or two I have all I need to write it I just don't know how to write it yet. Also I have a manse do you allow the construction rules of oadenols codex to built it ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"ke