k":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T12:38:08-07:00","id":152806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152755#post152755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I would wager a significant fraction of money I don't actually own that if every important person in the city already knows or will by the end of the day. Every important person in the country will know by the end of the week. Containment right now essentially means presenting a favorable impression first so that all discussion grows from the starting point we set. It is going to get out.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. The Ship has sailed. The Barn doors are open, the cows are gone, and the bag is utterly devoid of cats. This is most certainly because you guys went out to save some civilians and infrastructure, and not because someone happens to be going full on First Age and tossing around Social-Influence charms like there's no tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T12:51:25-07:00","id":152836,"title":"","content":"Two, I tossed around Two social-influence charms. Besides, only one of them was obvious. (I am sure everyone important knew then too.) But now they know there are many of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T13:02:00-07:00","id":152872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152806#post152806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes. The Ship has sailed. The Barn doors are open, the cows are gone, and the bag is utterly devoid of cats. This is most certainly because you guys went out to save some civilians and infrastructure, and not because someone happens to be going full on First Age and tossing around Social-Influence charms like there's no tomorrow.</div> </div> </div> </div>:Awesome:<br /> <br /> The art of ribbing the players continues.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:12:30-07:00","id":152959,"title":"","content":"Is it correct to assume that Artemia knows that I am a solar too ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:20:11-07:00","id":152967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152959#post152959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it correct to assume that Artemia knows that I am a solar too ?</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be correct, yes. However, you are one of her countrymen, and therefore are more trustworthy in her mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T14:29:42-07:00","id":152980,"title":"","content":"When I exalted did i get some kind of warning or meeting with some of the top brass ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:40:17-07:00","id":153231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=150952#post150952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have a history for my cadet house ?</div> </div> </div> </div><b>-House Antalek-</b><br /> <br /> This minor cadet family was adopted by Gens Nikoloi in the early seventh century post contagion. Formed from a small cadre of academically-inclined political dissidents from Theros, Nikoloi has long supported their continued specialization. Though not particularly large by even Cadet House standards, nearly every member of this House is a highly educated specialist in their chosen field; Antalek engineers can rival even Ptreas' in skill (though they lack the numbers and support infrastructure that makes the Ptreas so great), and Antalek's surgeons know no equal in Novalesk.<br /> <br /> The family is very specialized to this end, however. Very few members find trade in manual labor or in skill-based trades like smithing or carpentry. Also notably, this house has no military forces at all, relying solely on their Nikoloi allies to protect them. this serves to keep them firmly under their patron's control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:43:17-07:00","id":153234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152486#post152486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a shame that Exalted Survival charms that affect familiars kind of drop the ball. Then again, I have only looked at the ones available in Core. I'm not looking to make the dog every bit as good as the character, but let's see about making it so he isn't a liability in a fight later on.</div> </div> </div> </div>They only have them in the Core, as I can recall. <br /> <br /> However, this doesn't keep you from making Familiar enhancing charms though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:45:37-07:00","id":153236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152980#post152980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I exalted did i get some kind of warning or meeting with some of the top brass ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume that after you exalted you had a meeting with the Chancellor, and the High Elders of your house and Gens Nikoloi, who suggested that it would be a good idea to keep the whole Anathema thing as secret as possible, if only to keep the other powers in the region (specifically the local Immaculate Temple in Theros) from knowing you exist as long as possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:05:10-07:00","id":153261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152354#post152354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You intend to make him a badass I like it and later I can put things in him like Exalted healing and such thanks to craft genesis If you want.</div> </div> </div> </div>You would have to make sure you can convince Jensven that the dog wouldn't be harmed by it. Of course, there is this...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152597#post152597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You want the medicine charm Science of Mutation, or some of those Mutation dots as artifact things from Dreams.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that charm does look like something that can happen down the road. It will have to be a ways down the road, though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=152806#post152806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes. The Ship has sailed. The Barn doors are open, the cows are gone, and the bag is utterly devoid of cats. This is most certainly because you guys went out to save some civilians and infrastructure, and not because someone happens to be going full on First Age and tossing around Social-Influence charms like there's no tomorrow.</div> </div> </div> </div>Save civilians or hide my secret? Yeah, after a quick glance at the motivation I typed up for the character, I guess I was screwed either way.<br /> <br /> Thankfully, I am fairly certain Noodle won't go all &quot;Jerk GM&quot; and force me to choose between a lawful action or a good action. Of course, should that happen you should always anticipate that I will do the good thing and seek restitution for breaking the law later. (The preceding was entirely an attempt to make fun of some ST/GM styles and not me complaining or being antagonistic.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=153234#post153234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They only have them in the Core, as I can recall.<br /> <br /> However, this doesn't keep you from making Familiar enhancing charms though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I may try my hand at this down the road, charm creation that is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-29-2014, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:22:01-07:00","id":153290,"title":"","content":"Actually the science of Mutations is actually a charm that is on my list to get so that will help since I need it for my motivation <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:32:34-07:00","id":153295,"title":"","content":"I had actually intended to have a minor focus on Medicine charms since I had favored it. I figured it would be useful to help people get patched up after a scrap. It seems that my character is going to wind up being an assistant to Crafting/Medicine outside of battle. I have no problem with that. No problem at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T17:37:54-07:00","id":153301,"title":"","content":"Well that is good to hear and vykos is a an archive by himself so he will be able to help in your quest for knowledge on solars if you ask though he might not tell you everything he knows since he doesn't want to expose himself as a solar yet","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T18:16:30-07:00","id":153347,"title":"","content":"Meh. hyuga knows that the &quot;cat is out of the bag&quot; on being an &quot;anathema&quot;. He still hasn't really come to terms with being exalted yet either though. He can only think back to the anathema that brought trouble and death to his family and friends. He doesn't want to be seen by others as that monster. That was more role-playing than my actual thoughts on the situation. This town is only going to get more heated from here. <br /> <br /> I was originally going to build up medicine since my talk with Maia, but I am glad that someone else is doing that. Now I can focus on other things <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T18:26:27-07:00","id":154410,"title":"","content":"<b>-Rumor Mill-</b><br /> <br /> <b>Geherin #3</b><br /> <br /> -A race of blue one-eyed, -armed, and -legged raksha lies trapped underground below the Geherin forests.<br /> <br /> -A race of squirrel-men invade Geherin from the East each summer.<br /> <br /> -Finn Far-Striker has returned to flesh after death, and is now a pawn of one of the Lords of Death<br /> <br /> -The Geherin are a race of bloodthirsty cannibals<br /> <br /> Previous Geherin Rumors<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Unconfirmed (At least one true)<br /> -Horses have the same civil rights as humans in Geherin.<br /> -Geherin Skalds have long-lost magics that uproot trees and make them fight alongside their warriors.<br /> -The Geherin use ancient blood-magic to transform their foes into trees. This is how they grow their forests.<br /> <br /> Unconfirmed (At least one true)<br /> -Crescent tea transforms the eater into an animal over time.<br /> -Geherin warriors devour Wyld beasts to gain their strength.<br /> -Disputes between Geherin clans are solved through full-contact music battles.<br /> -In the Geherin forests, there lives an eight-foot tall man, with skin as pale as ivory and no hair; he channels the power of a primeval boar-demon to crush his foes.<br /> <br /> Confirmed Untrue<br /> -The Geherin are secretly run by a Lunar Anathema.<br /> -The Geherin are run by a troupe of Raksha.<br /> -The Geherin are a species of sentient, bipedal plant.<br /> -The Geherin are an advanced species of ape that wear human suits to make them feel like people.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-30-2014, 10:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T19:11:31-07:00","id":154439,"title":"","content":"I vote for the Abyssal, that seems the most likely to be a problem down the line. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T19:28:35-07:00","id":154453,"title":"","content":"Ooops! I forgot to move two of the initial rumors to the Confirmed Untrue list. It's been fixed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T19:37:13-07:00","id":154459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=154439#post154439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vote for the Abyssal, that seems the most likely to be a problem down the line. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You assume he's an Abyssal. &quot;Primeval Boar Demon&quot; screams &quot;Infernal with Isodoros charms&quot; to me. ;-) Or maybe I'm just being difficult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T20:31:46-07:00","id":154491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NutiketAiel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=154459#post154459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You assume he's an Abyssal. &quot;Primeval Boar Demon&quot; screams &quot;Infernal with Isodoros charms&quot; to me. ;-) Or maybe I'm just being difficult.</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously the Abyssal and Infernal are in league.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T21:51:42-07:00","id":154513,"title":"","content":"You both assume that it's an Abyssal and an Infernal. <br /> <br /> The &quot;Primeval Boar Demon&quot; dude could be an Infernal of either stripe, yes. It could also be a Demon, a God, a Behemoth, a God- or Demon-blood, or something unusual like a Half-Caste Behemoth Akuma. <br /> <br /> Finn Far-Striker could be a Liminal, or have been turned into a nephrack, or a necromantic war-machine, or have been BROUGHT BACK WRONG by the lowest, darkest levels of necromancy. Or he could be something boring like an Abyssal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T16:30:46-07:00","id":155295,"title":"","content":"<b>-Rumor Mill-</b><br /> <br /> <b>Ordon #3</b><br /> <br /> -The Ordoni are actually a communal hivemind<br /> <br /> -The Ordon have sent out quiet calls for outsiders to join their exploration teams, and offer a new perspective in the opening of the so-called 'Eightfold Door'.<br /> <br /> -The Ordon sacrifice those with the Dragon's Blood upon their unholy altars to grease the workings of their god-machine<br /> <br /> -The Ordon capture Fae and imprison them in jade cages to power their machines.<br /> <br /> Previous Ordon rumors<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Unconfirmed (at least one true)<br /> -Ordon's leadership caste is comprised of a group of quasi-divine Jade statues. These beings lead the Ordoni in the worship of a mechanical god run by smoke and clockwork.<br /> -Ordon sits upon a portal to an alien world of darkness and metal. A Realm of Brass and Shadows, if you will.<br /> -Ordon is a Lookshan puppet-state.<br /> -All residents of Ordon have their brain removed and replaced with a machine when they reach adulthood.<br /> -Ordoni are not born, they're grown.<br /> -The Ordon have dug too greedily and too deep. In so doing, they've released something dark and evil.<br /> -Ordon is built atop a military facility constructed as a fallout bunker by a paranoid Anathema god-king in the Age of Glories.<br /> -The Ordon build clockwork men and use them as warriors.<br /> <br /> Unconfirmed (at least one true)<br /> -Ordon is built on a burial ground dating back to the first war between the gods and demons.<br /> -The Ordoni wage an eternal war with an infinite army of underground demons.<br /> -Ordoni prophets replace their eyes with metallic orbs to receive visions from their god.<br /> - The Ordoni worship focuses on trio of divinities, known as the Architect, the Maker, and the Engineer.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T19:23:33-07:00","id":155371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=154410#post154410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Finn Far-Striker has returned to flesh after death, and is now a pawn of one of the Lords of Death</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a fan of Abyssals and this pick shows it. Previous comments seem to suggest that calling this guy just an Abyssal would be boring, but I'm going to be boring.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=155295#post155295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-The Ordon capture Fae and imprison them in jade cages to power their machines.</div> </div> </div> </div>How funny would this be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T20:19:34-07:00","id":155406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=155371#post155371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a fan of Abyssals and this pick shows it. Previous comments seem to suggest that calling this guy just an Abyssal would be boring, but I'm going to be boring.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not saying that Abyssals are boring. I certainly enjoy making them, especially after I decided to name them all after Dr Seuss stories, and extrapolate their characteristics from the overly-pretentious Abyssalized title (I'm a big fan of the Spiteful Thief of Festive Jollity, and the Mendicant Vulpine Adorned With Bloodsoaked Stockings). <br /> <br /> What I'm saying is that assuming that anything that any sort of fleshy semi-intelligent undead is an Abyssal would be boring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T20:48:34-07:00","id":155416,"title":"","content":"Noodle, The Novaleski are the people of Novalesk which Larissa is right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T21:44:44-07:00","id":155433,"title":"","content":"Yes. However, Larissa is the goddess of Novalesk's citizenry. Remember, in Novalesk 'Citizen' means &quot;Person with the Franchise&quot;, not &quot;Governmentally accepted member of this nation&quot;.<br /> <br /> Larissa's purview is essentially &quot;Novaleski Essence Users&quot; or &quot;Novalesk's Aristocracy&quot;, not &quot;Novalesk's populace&quot;.<br /> <br /> Yes, you can change it if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T00:07:53-07:00","id":155529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=155433#post155433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. However, Larissa is the goddess of Novalesk's citizenry. Remember, in Novalesk 'Citizen' means &quot;Person with the Franchise&quot;, not &quot;Governmentally accepted member of this nation&quot;.<br /> <br /> Larissa's purview is essentially &quot;Novaleski Essence Users&quot; or &quot;Novalesk's Aristocracy&quot;, not &quot;Novalesk's populace&quot;.<br /> <br /> Yes, you can change it if you want.</div> </div> </div> </div>There, changed it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T16:34:42-07:00","id":156080,"title":"","content":"Question Noodle what is your rules for working with craft genesis because I fully intend to use it so I would like to know how it's gonna work ? Since in the book it's not well explained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T16:41:08-07:00","id":156081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=156080#post156080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question Noodle what is your rules for working with craft genesis because I fully intend to use it so I would like to know how it's gonna work ? Since in the book it's not well explained.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe I understand the rules well enough. What do you want to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T16:58:15-07:00","id":156089,"title":"","content":"huh... Sure long story short I intend to take a human template and introduce a crap load of mutations into it to make a new crafted race, along with some artificial birthing bio-tech to make they number grow faster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-01-2014, 08:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T17:48:05-07:00","id":156107,"title":"","content":"You cannot yet do what you want.<br /> <br /> Until you have an Artifact 5 Genesis laboratory you are limited to 2 dot genesis artifacts. Second, breeding true raises the rating of a genesis artifact by one meaning your practical limit is level 1 artifacts. (You could lower the rating by one, but that makes the creature dependent on expensive substances.)<br /> <br /> As for the actual rating: The one in Wonders is kind of vague, so I use the Chaomorphic Symbiote table in Dreams for baseline mutation points per level. (This has a lot of wiggle room and Noodle could do things differently). By that guideline, the People of the Air are artifact 4 each.<br /> <br /> Technology wise, the only way to speed up reproduction is the five dot Genesis Laboratory Manse power, CNNT if you are making them yourself, or the Terrestrial Circle Spell Summoning the Harvest (only works on animals)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T19:23:03-07:00","id":156142,"title":"","content":"Well I didn't say I was gonna do it now I need to test things first so I'm gonna limit myself to replicate some of the vegetative technology of the dragon kings and some minor mutations at first until I get access to a genesis lab so it's just to test the water right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T20:18:01-07:00","id":156191,"title":"","content":"In that case:<br /> <br /> You want a level five manse with the Genesis Laboratory power (it requires Craft Magitech and Genesis 6). This will allow you to mass produce mortals with your new template in batches that get smaller the more mutation points you add.<br /> <br /> Baring that, you want an artifact 5 craft genesis lab.<br /> <br /> You design a mutation package (which any players of this race will need to spend BP on) consisting of negative and positive mutations. Then you make an artifact crafting roll as normal with the person with the mutations as the result. Breeding true raises the artifact rating by one. (As a narrative concern, you will want a large initial population to prevent inbreeding)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-02-2014, 07:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T15:19:40-07:00","id":156937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=155529#post155529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There, changed it.</div> </div> </div> </div>And the reflected response is in the new post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T16:07:44-07:00","id":156994,"title":"","content":"<b>-Rumor Mill-</b><br /> <br /> <b>Theros #3</b><br /> <br /> - The Realm is moving forces into Theros for an attempt to capture and purify the Forests of Bone.<br /> <br /> -Theros has a gateway to a flying city populated by a race of bird-men<br /> <br /> -Theros is training a professional military force for the purpose of conquering Ordon<br /> <br /> -The Sorcerer-Lord, Sigmund of House Rerir, has been betrothed to a recently Exalted member of Gens Ptreas.<br /> <br /> Previous Theros Rumors<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Unconfirmed (At least one true)<br /> -The Realm uses Theros as a dumping ground for illegitimate yet unexalted children.<br /> -Theros' actual king is an ancient bird-man swordsman who lives in a nearby shadowland.<br /> -Theros is bent on conquering the surrounding Nations as part of an elaborate plot to encircle Nasaru and Gunzota Redoubts.<br /> -King Urlik of Theros has been possessed by the baleful spirit of his black blade.<br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Black Cowl', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Gilded Triangle', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> - An Anathema cult, known as the 'Haired Beast', secretly controls Theros' aristocracy.<br /> <br /> Unconfirmed (At least one true)<br /> -The Dynast Cynis Hara Yusuke owns a mansion in Theros, where he hosts drug-fueled orgies for Theros' elite.<br /> -In Theros, there lives a green-haired mercenary who can best even Immaculate Masters in one-on-one combat; it is said that she will take on any contract, so long as you give her enough liquor.<br /> -In Theros, if you hang your stockings outside your window on a moonless night, the Granter of Wishes will fill them with your heart's desire, so long as your heart's desire would fit comfortably inside.<br /> -Theros is preparing for an invasion of Novalesk.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T16:09:01-07:00","id":156995,"title":"","content":"<b>-Rumor Mill-<br /> <br /> The Lands of Shadow</b><br /> The Spectral Falcon, lord of the Ash-Mount Hill, has tamed a legion of Hekatonkhires.<br /> <br /> -The Monarch Raised Upon the Bones of Trees has created a dark pact with the ghastly Anathema Necromancer, the Codicier of Final Repose.<br /> <br /> -The Minister of the Chambers has been purchasing dream-eaten slaves from the Guild<br /> <br /> - In the North of the Forests of Bone, there lies a black-stone shrine to a powerful spirit. If one chants twice the name of this spirit before stating a problem that plagues them, the spirit will appear and grant them the knowledge and tools required to solve the problem. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T16:13:09-07:00","id":157021,"title":"","content":"Magnusar- I stand by what Exthalion said, regarding you project. Seems like solid advice to me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T17:26:47-07:00","id":157127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/genera