in the library and it was beautiful. I clicked over to add my link to the dice roll and tried to switch back and hit the x on accident and lost it all &gt;&gt; I am so mad right now :/</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><i><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It is impossible to separate a cube into two cubes, or a fourth power into two fourth powers, or in general, any power higher than the second, into two like powers. I have discovered a truly marvellous proof of this, which this margin is too narrow to contain.</span></i></span></span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:28:26-07:00","id":178628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=178566#post178566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't that 1d(infinity)? Aleph is the cardinality of infinite sets.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, yes it is. Take it as a complement; I couldn't think of a finite number large enough to ensure that it would be larger than whatever Yi could get. And even if I thought it was large enough, then this would likely ensue:<br /> <br /> Noodle: It would be 1d[large but finite number], so it's larger than whatever Yi could get.<br /> Exthalion: .... Challenge accepted. <br /> <br /> Also, it was meant entirely in jest, which would have come off as much more hostile with a finite figure. The entire thing is essentially me vocally rolling my eyes at the capabilities of social-fu characters like Tirien and Yi at convincing people to do shit with their charms. <br /> <br /> I suppose I could have used 1dX, but hindsight's 20/20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:36:41-07:00","id":178630,"title":"","content":"Ah, my mistake. I wasn't entirely sure what was being discussed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:55:11-07:00","id":178646,"title":"","content":"Noodle and I were joking that that could have led to an inadvertent Lensman Arms Race, but that's another thing entirely, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"}