e:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T13:03:56-07:00","id":195697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=195694#post195694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably but I don't think I'll go after them even though I asked, the chance of finding Genesis artifact in them are rare.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but there would be no stopping Hyuga from going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T13:15:56-07:00","id":195705,"title":"","content":"Guardians, traps, other scavenger lord and much worse can be waiting in the dept of a solar tomb which also is why I am not going <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T16:13:42-07:00","id":195819,"title":"","content":"Alright! An artifact detecter artifact it is. Detects the amount of artifacts and the power level within a few miles on a simple screen! find empty tombs quick!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T17:44:00-07:00","id":195856,"title":"","content":"Question: What is an artifact?<br /> <br /> The process that produces them are as diverse as that of mundane craft if no more so. A sky-mantis tower has definite energy emissions if it is on, but what about when it isn't? What sort of mojo is a daiklave putting out when it isn't attuned? Why can't this thing detect Exalts since they have an anima that is always around them? What about gods or spirits?<br /> <br /> Why does it work such that it can detect all artifacts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T18:46:47-07:00","id":195918,"title":"","content":"An artifact would be an object that has been infused with magical materials or enhanced with spells. The artifact finder would have to be able to sense magics placed on objects. It would detect a sky-mantis even if it was not powered on. I suppose it would have to detect magic and just magical materials in general in the area too. So it would not be perfect, but it could still tell when there was a store of artifacts or magic placed on an area. Typically those are places of interest. Since it can detect the amount of artifacts/magic, making guesses on where storage places were would be a bit easier. <br /> <br /> It could also warn you of magics placed on an area for a trap or illusion. That would let a caster counter-magic the effect. If the counter-spell failed, most likely it would be an artifact. It could also be a magical material to use for crafting. Otherwise, it would just tell you where an artifact was! You may find manses like that as well though.<br /> <br /> Objects from spells like &quot;Coin of distant vision&quot;, &quot;spirit sword&quot;, and those enhanced with &quot;ritual of elemental empowerment&quot; would show up. So again, it is not a solve all and can be misled, but that just leads to more adventures!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T21:16:40-07:00","id":195999,"title":"","content":"Per the guidelines in Oadenol's an E4-5 solar level charm equivalent effect is artifact 4. Theion has Cosmos Bleaching Revelation at E3 which targets one object. Its E4 upgrade expands it to a non magical structure max of Essence*2 yards in any direction.<br /> <br /> The Revelatory Blindfold in Glories: Maidens is Artifact 2 for AESS.<br /> <br /> This thing is minimum Artifact 5 for a crazy short range. Probably N/A for anything approaching actively looking for things range.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T23:16:17-07:00","id":196056,"title":"","content":"I was mostly just kidding about the artifact finder... mostly just to bother the ST. It would definitely be artifact 5 or N/A. I was not planning on nor capable of making it. I dont know what AESS had to with it anyway... that was for my goggles. I am not sure what I am going to make. I am mostly just throwing out ideas for right now. bouncing ideas off others is a great way for me to get ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:41:14-07:00","id":197562,"title":"","content":"Due to the circumstances of play, I'm going to start granting the following intimacies:<br /> <br /> Tirien: Dero (positive) +2 steps, Geherin (positive) +1 step<br /> Hyuga: Maia (positive) +2 steps, Jensven (positive) +1 step<br /> Yi: Larissa (positive) +2 steps, Shu-Yin (negative) +1 step<br /> Jensven: Hyuga (postive) +1 step, Maia (positive) +1 step<br /> <br /> You'll need to come up with the exact context of the intimacies; I don't want to tell you how to RP your PCs. But bear in mind that I will veto any contexts that don't make sense with the way you've been RP your interactions with aforesaid parties. <br /> <br /> So, what are the contexts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:56:44-07:00","id":197570,"title":"","content":"For Hyuga, Maia's intimacy would be that of an &quot;intellectual companion&quot; and &quot;blooming affection&quot;.<br /> His intimacy towards Jensven would be that of an &quot;old buddy&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T00:05:08-07:00","id":197628,"title":"","content":"If anyone was curious about Blossom's spellcasting, the Mudra of Telecommunication looks very much like this:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://thumbs.dreamstime.com/x/woman-call-me-phone-hand-sign-26419925.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T12:24:49-07:00","id":198113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=197562#post197562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Due to the circumstances of play, I'm going to start granting the following intimacies:<br /> <br /> Tirien: Dero (positive) +2 steps, Geherin (positive) +1 step<br /> Hyuga: Maia (positive) +2 steps, Jensven (positive) +1 step<br /> Yi: Larissa (positive) +2 steps, Shu-Yin (negative) +1 step<br /> Jensven: Hyuga (postive) +1 step, Maia (positive) +1 step<br /> <br /> You'll need to come up with the exact context of the intimacies; I don't want to tell you how to RP your PCs. But bear in mind that I will veto any contexts that don't make sense with the way you've been RP your interactions with aforesaid parties.<br /> <br /> So, what are the contexts?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Larissa: Flirtatious Friendship<br /> Shu-Yin: Annoyed Antagonism","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T07:11:55-07:00","id":198917,"title":"","content":"I'm a little confused about the steps. Are these analogous to scenes spent building intimacies and therefore we don't actually have these intimacies, but we will after we spend more scenes doing that?<br /> <br /> Maia: Brotherly Affection<br /> Hyuga: Comrade in Arms/Fellow Tradesman","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T16:30:45-07:00","id":199393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=198917#post198917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a little confused about the steps. Are these analogous to scenes spent building intimacies and therefore we don't actually have these intimacies, but we will after we spend more scenes doing that?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is correct.<br /> <br /> Since I have now looked at the PC's conviction ratings, Yi and Hyuga have obtained full-fledged intimacies toward Larissa and Maia, respectively. All other intimacies are still 'under-construction'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T17:01:45-07:00","id":199421,"title":"","content":"<b>Rumor Mill Time: Shadowlands #2!</b><br /> <br /> (at least one true)<br /> <br /> - The Minister of the Forests of Bone is importing large quantities of salt.<br /> - The Bone Monarch is preparing to open in Necromantic academy.<br /> - The Forests of Bone were recently invaded from the west by a barbarian horde.<br /> - The recent Therian dead are building a polity on the Ash-mount Hill.<br /> <br /> Also, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1REaxoY-sraYz6KhQXMEWKWW278n-1GbakIYIUgoOrXg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Doc Updated</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T20:34:09-07:00","id":199588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=198394#post198394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She'll tell Dero to return to Novalesk with the Thunderbird, and to prepare the necessary logistics with Eugene and his grandfather in preparation for the Vicruith's arrival. She'll also tell him that she'll need to leave and perform some duties on her own, and that she doesn't wish for him to get injured, which may happen. She trusts his judgement and knows he can handle this until she returns.</div> </div> </div> </div>Poor Dero. One Day an attractive intimidating woman will appreciate him for more than his Larceny score and family connections. One day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T10:14:25-07:00","id":200180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=199588#post199588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Poor Dero. One Day an attractive intimidating woman will appreciate him for more than his Larceny score and family connections. One day.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think of Tirien as intimidating. She hasn't eaten anyone (In-game, anyways), and she's probably the most down to earth of the Circle. <br /> <br /> Also, for her developing intimacies:<br /> Dero (Platonic Affection)<br /> Geherin (Impressed Respect)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T21:35:21-07:00","id":203481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=200180#post200180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think of Tirien as intimidating. She hasn't eaten anyone (In-game, anyways), and she's probably the most down to earth of the Circle.</div> </div> </div> </div>She punched out a Fae noble. That's pretty damn intimidating to your average Joe. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:23:48-07:00","id":203518,"title":"","content":"Oh, Exthalion. A thought came to me the last time you went into the Boule, and I was just reminded of it now. You said that your blade was tied the the struggle between Lasshe and the Ignis Divine, and represented UCS's potentiality of victory. This is an awesome concept, and I like. I like very much. But, one thing. <br /> <br /> Short Diaklaives are paired weapons. <br /> <br /> Think about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T05:11:22-07:00","id":203744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=203518#post203518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, Exthalion. A thought came to me the last time you went into the Boule, and I was just reminded of it now. You said that your blade was tied the the struggle between Lasshe and the Ignis Divine, and represented UCS's potentiality of victory. This is an awesome concept, and I like. I like very much. But, one thing.<br /> <br /> Short Diaklaives are paired weapons.<br /> <br /> Think about that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy. Freakin'. Howl.<br /> <br /> I have a theory on this one, but I'mma keep it bottle up until we get some input from Exthalion on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T13:37:28-07:00","id":204180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=203744#post203744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Holy. Freakin'. Howl.<br /> <br /> I have a theory on this one, but I'mma keep it bottle up until we get some input from Exthalion on it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be very surprised if anyone comes to a conclusion that I wasn't trying to communicate with that statement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:43:57-07:00","id":204260,"title":"","content":"Lets see: <br /> <br /> 1. A companion blade needs to be forged to complete the victory.<br /> 2. A companion does exist but is formed of Moonsilver and represents Luna's role in the conflict<br /> 3. A companion does exist and represents Lasshe's victory<br /> 4. A companion does exist and represents Lasshe's defeat<br /> 5. Were a companion forged it would mean that the current suspension of hostilities would come to an end<br /> 6. Multiple companion's exist representing the addition of Solars to the fight<br /> 7. Multiple companion's need to be forged to represent the addition of force needed for the Sun to win<br /> 8. A companion exists/the material required for it exist and are held by the Sun representing his own reluctance/unworthiness/doubt/etc.<br /> <br /> 8 is the Sun's holy number so I will stop there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:58:00-07:00","id":204273,"title":"","content":"Rumor Mill Time! Since the last one didn't get a whole lot of attention, this one's going to be big!<br /> <br /> <b>Novalesk #4</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> - Elements of Gens Zophyrus want to sell Novalesk out to Theros<br /> - Gens Ptreas pays bandits to attack other Gentes' hinterland holdings to convince them to build Ptreas walls.<br /> - Pachis Terakon has invented an Alchemical formula that transmutes a subject into its/their most optimal form.<br /> - Strategos Vasil patronizes a guild-affiliated Fae-blooded courtesan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:58:34-07:00","id":204275,"title":"","content":"<b>Geherin #4</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> - The legendary lost boomerang-sword of legend has been recovered, in the hands of a ghastly warrior.<br /> - The Geherin have a deathly fear of boats.<br /> - The Geherin breed a species of Giant Boar that they both consume and use as war-beasts.<br /> - The Geherin ritually sacrifice bands of the surrounding nomads to appease their tree-gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:58:50-07:00","id":204276,"title":"","content":"I would gamble on 3, as Lasshe was Sol's Bizzaro Doppelganger, and so, without Luna's intervention, it could've gone either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:59:07-07:00","id":204278,"title":"","content":"<b>Ordon #4</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> - The Ordoni are refugees from a doomed technologically advanced alternate-Creation<br /> - The Ordoni eat rocks.<br /> - Ordon are creating a fleet of underground ships to conquer the surrounding nations<br /> - Ordon obtains its technology by feeding a gigantic underground shoggoth-worm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T14:59:41-07:00","id":204280,"title":"","content":"<b>Theros #4</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> - An ancient hermit lives in southern Theros, growing Peaches of Immortality<br /> - The Ebon Sky-Whale has once again been sighted in the skies over Theros.<br /> - Queen Kymril of Theros is engaged in a clandestine relationship with her brother-in-law, the Crown Prince. <br /> - Abess Dozen Whispers, the head of Theros' Immaculate Temple, is actually a member of the Gilded Triangle","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T15:00:52-07:00","id":204282,"title":"","content":"<b>Shadowlands #3</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> -The dread Hekatonkhire, Queltoss the Jade Hydra, has taken up residence in the Therian underworld.<br /> -Raksha nobles from the Church of Balor are trading with the government of the Forests of Bone.<br /> -The Codicier of Final Repose is constructing a network of War-manses throughout the local Underworld.<br /> -There are a clan of vampiric humans who live in Novalesk\u2019s underworld, and hunt ghosts to make ghost-leather clothes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1REaxoY-sraYz6KhQXMEWKWW278n-1GbakIYIUgoOrXg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Compilation Updated</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T17:44:15-07:00","id":204437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204280#post204280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Theros #4</b><br /> <br /> <b>At least one true</b><br /> - An ancient hermit lives in southern Theros, growing Peaches of Immortality<br /> - The Ebon Sky-Whale has once again been sighted in the skies over Theros.<br /> - Queen Kymril of Theros is engaged in a clandestine relationship with her brother-in-law, the Crown Prince.<br /> - Abess Dozen Whispers, the head of Theros' Immaculate Temple, is actually a member of the Gilded Triangle</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> One is false, since they only grow in Yu-Shan, have to be watered with ambrosia, and take like a thousand years to ripen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T18:31:24-07:00","id":204510,"title":"","content":"Wow, Yi is ballsy. Serious kudos for whatever crazy plan you're concocting, Exthalion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T10:16:47-07:00","id":205116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=199421#post199421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Rumor Mill Time: Shadowlands #2</b><br /> - The Bone Monarch is preparing to open in Necromantic academy.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204260#post204260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. A companion does exist and represents Lasshe's victory</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this is the most likely, but the others would be darn interesting to explore. I love it when a player gives a ST fuel for the story.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204273#post204273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Novalesk #4</b><br /> - Strategos Vasil patronizes a guild-affiliated Fae-blooded courtesan.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204275#post204275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Geherin #4</b><br /> - The Geherin have a deathly fear of boats.</div> </div> </div> </div>For the Lawlz.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204278#post204278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Ordon #4</b><br /> - The Ordoni are refugees from a doomed technologically advanced alternate-Creation</div> </div> </div> </div>This one really jives with a bunch of others. If those are proved, this one could be as well. If those are disproved...you get the idea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204280#post204280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Theros #4</b><br /> - Queen Kymril of Theros is engaged in a clandestine relationship with her brother-in-law, the Crown Prince.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=204282#post204282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Shadowlands #3</b><br /> -The Codicier of Final Repose is constructing a network of War-manses throughout the local Underworld.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would just be too epic considering what a few of the characters are considering doing down the road.<br /> <br /> These are the ones I am going to go with. Because reasons! (If not mentioned)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 07-22-2014, 01:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T14:33:29-07:00","id":209530,"title":"","content":"I am going to say:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">1. Ordon's leadership caste is comprised of a group of quasi-divine Jade statues. These beings lead the Ordoni in the worship of a mechanical god run by smoke and clockwork.<br /> 2. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Ordoni wage an eternal war with an infinite army of underground demons.<br /> 3. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Ordon capture Fae and imprison them in jade cages to power their machines.<br /> <br /> They are ruled by the Jadeborn and the humans have such a strong caste system because of the way they were integrated into the Jadeborn's natural (you know what I mean) castes. Thus why they are diplomats and the like, since the Jadeborn can't go to the surface. The vast influx of materials is sent to the Jadeborn either directly or as raw material for the fight against the Darkbrood. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> 3 just feels like it fits the overall feel.<br /> <br /> Edit: Yi doesn't know any of this.<br /> <br /> Edit 2: The &quot;sins&quot; are the Solar's commanding Autochthon to create the Great Geas.<br /> <br /> My plan is to become Archon and appoint Larisa as my proxy while I am away.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Dietaku, would you mind accompanying me as something smalish? Say my familiar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 07-26-2014, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T18:03:45-07:00","id":210681,"title":"","content":"1) That hypothesis does jell well with the information doesn't it? It would also explain how the Ordoni apparently field units of automaton soldiers. <br /> <br /> 2) You still haven't done anything that would help you get through the legal hurdles of becoming Archon.<br /> <br /> 3) You presume the Ordon haven't had dealings with Lunars in the past, and aren't reasonably informed as to their capabilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T18:37:26-07:00","id":210691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=210681#post210681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) That hypothesis does jell well with the information doesn't it? It would also explain how the Ordoni apparently field units of automaton soldiers.<br /> <br /> 2) You still haven't done anything that would help you get through the legal hurdles of becoming Archon.<br /> <br /> 3) You presume the Ordon haven't had dealings with Lunars in the past, and aren't reasonably informed as to their capabilities.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1. ST doubletalk to cause confusion and fear! You shall not undermine my insane theories!<br /> <br /> 2. No, but legal hurdles are formalities with enough power at your back. Silly things like proving your royal blood just require you to pay someone to draw up a chart. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> 3. Nothing of the sort! But Tirien has a much better chance of making it out alive and raising an angry barbarian hoard to avenge me should they prove violent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T05:24