d have someone to talk to.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the upcoming battle, Jensven will need to leave right after he finishes his week of study to increase Lore if he wants to be able to take the fight to the fairies, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>That should have been in here, yes. No worries, though. Do whatever you need to. <br /> <br /> As for the time table, no. Jensven will have at least three or four weeks after that before the army ships out. This is of course, assuming he doesn't head out early. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T06:38:28-07:00","id":248783,"title":"","content":"Knowing Jensven, he believes he is still a support role (armorer) to those that can actually fight. He is slowly coming to realize he is pretty freaking awesome in a fight, but he isn't confident enough to act on it. We might need to get Sol Invictus to give him a God Kicking Boot to the rear end...<br /> <br /> He will stick around until the army leaves. This is, of course assuming nobody mentions that the knights are up against it and need reinforcement before then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T10:32:21-07:00","id":249928,"title":"","content":"Sorry I have not been posting. I have been changing jobs, taking trainings, helping people move, camping, and just am over-all busy, busy, busy. Things SHOULD be slowing down now. I will start trying to post more. Sorry!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1480-citanhyuga","name":"CitanHyuga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1480_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T16:02:06-07:00","id":250201,"title":"","content":"Don't worry about it, man. We all get to those points when life is going too fast and we don't have time for things that aren't essential to the day to day. Glad to have you back and let's have fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T12:13:04-07:00","id":250976,"title":"","content":"Okay, I am thinking of initiating into sorcery and learning demon summoning. How does this work as a demon?<br /> <br /> Black El'nor, the Iron Birds<br /> <br /> Have you seen their eyeless faces, as they mock in dreary places?<br /> Where brooding kings in raukus halls, suffer pity forever more.<br /> One word songs forever keening, the iron wails that none are needing,<br /> Repeat advice to ears unheeding: &quot;Forget the past&quot; they oft implore.<br /> The reeking ache that dreams are dying, fairy kings can scarce ignore;<br /> Those demon birds, the black El'nore!<br /> <br /> Does any fool think the Demon Princes do not pity themselves? Does any fool think they hate that pity more than pain? So came about the raven birds that later sages called the El'nor. Standing tall as mortals, wearing iron masks as face, they mock the yozi and unquestionables and are allowed to live. For the endless serfs it is no crime to kill them, and doing so has put a fleeting smile on the faces of the mightiest. For a citizen their blood is a mark of shame, for the third circles it is a death sentence. What it would mean for a yozi to kill one is unknown, for it has never occurred.<br /> <br /> It is not so strange a thing; to slay them is to acknowledge them, and it is the purpose of the multitudes to divert their betters from the endless malaise of imprisonment. Yet for the very souls of the Yozi to do so is to invite the shadow of myth ending doubt and eternity swallowing apathy. For this reason the demon kings hold them less tightly than other spawn, and few ancient kings or savants have claimed not to see a raven perched on some tree or window as they consider a lifetime of regrets.<br /> <br /> The fairfolk fear and hate them, for they stand for the utter wrongness of shape. Once unchanging form has accumulated, history grown fat on expended time, and the sheer weight of existence has become a horror; that is when the black birds come.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T16:05:25-07:00","id":251118,"title":"","content":"That seems like a neat idea for a FCD. Question, though. How do you intend to learn these arts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T18:02:03-07:00","id":251172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=251118#post251118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That seems like a neat idea for a FCD. Question, though. How do you intend to learn these arts?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I had a few thoughts:<br /> <br /> First: I am an Exalted with favored abilities and so can initiate myself in a few days. Similarly I can learn the spell through the Salnian Working (how much information does Lore 5 grant about the working?)<br /> Second: There is an academy or sorcery a convenient walk away. Even if there is no sorcerer there, they can likely point me to someone who can teach me.<br /> Third: One of the gods I know should have some advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T17:14:19-07:00","id":251773,"title":"","content":"Who would the sire of the Iron Birds be, anyways? They sound like something that Adorjan would have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T17:41:31-07:00","id":251789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=251773#post251773\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who would the sire of the Iron Birds be, anyways? They sound like something that Adorjan would have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Funny you should ask, because I thought the same thing. Or perhaps they are descended from Lypothymie, (and thus Hegra) who is an emotion sort of like depression.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T21:22:46-07:00","id":252967,"title":"","content":"The could also be the Ebon Dragon's, made to &quot;flip the bird&quot; (pun intentional) to the other Yozis. Or they could be Cecelyne, because of the large amount of legalese that surrounds them. Or they could be Oramus or Cytheria because they have supper weird progenitive powers. <br /> <br /> Regarding your plan to learn sorcery and Demon of the First Circle: the sorcery initiation is sound. Origenes or the academy could tutor you to get access to the Terrestrial Circle Sorcery charm. On the other hand, there's exactly two people in the country who have the Spell you want; Vykos and Feiro. Getting their time might be more difficult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T19:01:28-07:00","id":253756,"title":"","content":"So... ah...<br /> <br /> Was that stunt enough to dramatically edit the past three days into training time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T21:06:53-07:00","id":253797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=253756#post253756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... ah...<br /> <br /> Was that stunt enough to dramatically edit the past three days into training time?</div> </div> </div> </div>You were training another Charm, so no. Pretty awesome though, you will get your deserts. Also, the expansion of the backstory, especially the introduction of Asclepius was a nice touch. Well done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T14:27:27-07:00","id":256247,"title":"","content":"What would you think about my odds of getting my paws on a weapon with these stats (mundane, of course): Speed 5, Accuracy 1, Damage 6L/2, Rate 2, Mins: Str 2, Tags: 1.5, O<br /> <br /> This is part of a fan-made weapon compendium I was able to find. It is called a Straight Baster Sword. There are thrusting, chopping, and slashing varieties as well. The 1.5 tag basically means I need to have my second hand free to support wielding it unless I want to one-hand it and take a -1 penalty for every point my Stregth doesn't meet a requirement of double the normal requirement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T19:47:03-07:00","id":256956,"title":"","content":"What's its defense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T20:21:12-07:00","id":256960,"title":"","content":"Sorry, Defense is 1 for the sword. It also costs Resources 3, if that matters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://fo