IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T14:08:20-07:00","id":266998,"title":"","content":"Sorry it has taken me so long to post IC. Posts like that require some thought since I basically did the same thing in my walking to the academy description, going through each of the stations in turn. (Also, the station of sacrifice is always last so by definition he has to have gone through the rest of them). Right now I am wondering what information I can actually give out to avoid sensitive information.<br /> <br /> I am also considering a/the sacred snake of Asclepius as a familiar/ally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T18:24:45-07:00","id":270521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=266112#post266112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woot! I will have to see about acquiring a couple...Then try to get Hyuga to make two of the Artifact Version! Perhaps they can even have special abilities. Paired Short Daiklaves? That's cute...I got these!<br /> <br /> Speed 5, Accuracy +1, Damage +8L/3, Defense +1, Rate 2, Tags: 1.5, O Attune 7 Artifact Rating 3 (More with special abilities, of course)</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems to be splitting the difference between a daiklaive and a grand daiklaive. Looks alright to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:23:41-07:00","id":270531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=270521#post270521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Seems to be splitting the difference between a daiklaive and a grand daiklaive. Looks alright to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was the intent with both the mundane and artifact weapons. I wanted to split the difference between the one handed and two handed blades.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T17:00:37-07:00","id":284352,"title":"","content":"Okay, guys, I have some good news and some bad news. Good news is that Magnusar is rejoining the game! He's currently in the process of making his new character.<br /> <br /> Bad news is that we've lost Nutiket (permanently) and Hyuga (maybe not permanently). This has slowed down my posting (big sorry!) cause I've had to figure out how to alter my plot lines to accommodate this, and the increasing number of NPC celestial exalts that are now in this relative backwater. <br /> <br /> So! With my plot lines as salvaged as can be, the simplest fix I can get for this is to have Hyuga and Vykos leave on an undisclosed errand of indefinite length. That should get them out of the primary plot lines, while still allowing for either to come back if necessary. <br /> <br /> The Blossom issue is more tricky, as Tirien and her are on an adventure that she was driving. I think the best solution for this is to retcon events such that she showed up in Geherin, gave Tirien cryptic advice in stereotypical Sidereal fashion before leaving mysteriously, also in stereotypical Sidereal fashion. This would retroactively put Tirien in Geherin all along.<br /> <br /> Also, since both Yi and Jensven are currently engaged in training, I think a short time-skip in Novalesk is in order.<br /> <br /> Is this alright with everyone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T17:23:54-07:00","id":284356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=284352#post284352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, guys, I have some good news and some bad news. Good news is that Magnusar is rejoining the game! He's currently in the process of making his new character.<br /> <br /> Bad news is that we've lost Nutiket (permanently) and Hyuga (maybe not permanently). This has slowed down my posting (big sorry!) cause I've had to figure out how to alter my plot lines to accommodate this, and the increasing number of NPC celestial exalts that are now in this relative backwater.<br /> <br /> So! With my plot lines as salvaged as can be, the simplest fix I can get for this is to have Hyuga and Vykos leave on an undisclosed errand of indefinite length. That should get them out of the primary plot lines, while still allowing for either to come back if necessary.<br /> <br /> The Blossom issue is more tricky, as Tirien and her are on an adventure that she was driving. I think the best solution for this is to retcon events such that she showed up in Geherin, gave Tirien cryptic advice in stereotypical Sidereal fashion before leaving mysteriously, also in stereotypical Sidereal fashion. This would retroactively put Tirien in Geherin all along.<br /> <br /> Also, since both Yi and Jensven are currently engaged in training, I think a short time-skip in Novalesk is in order.<br /> <br /> Is this alright with everyone?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is fine with me. (Hopefully by the end of it all the social magic I keep throwing around will take hold. It would be undignified running around shouting &quot;Love Me!&quot; backed by UMI at all the people.) (That was a joke.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T18:21:08-07:00","id":284428,"title":"","content":"Sounds good to me, although Tirien will most likely be terribly confused.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6