rings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T17:28:23-08:00","id":320266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=318963#post318963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...And the &quot;Kevin&quot; joke from when you guys visited that first Freehold finally makes sense for me. Phineas and Ferb was after my time, I'm afraid. I do appreciate the &quot;Hobbit&quot; references, though. I remember watching that after Thanksgiving dinner as a boy darn near religiously.<br /> <br /> Also, 'What happens after the Bone Monarch invades Theros?&quot; I go all Cecil Harvey on fools. Or maybe you would prefer Uther Lightbringer?</div> </div> </div> </div>Truth be told, it's a little after our times as well, but our little sister is into it, and Andrew and I learned that, ultimately, children;s cartoons are freakin' weird. <br /> <br /> Funnily enough, Ba Rai, Esstrayan and Tao Mei are all from our first Exalted game, along with a trio of Green Sun Princes that Magnusar and Exthalion may remember. I'm not sure if Noodle will use them, but I think it would be funny as hell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T18:06:47-08:00","id":320288,"title":"","content":"I would like to solve the puzzle, Pat.<br /> <br /> Si-Ni-Da = Cinder<br /> Da = The<br /> Fe-Fa-Du = Favored<br /> Si-O-No = Son<br /> O-Fa = Of<br /> Da = The<br /> Ga-Re-Ta = Great<br /> Ga-Ra-Da = Garda<br /> Ba-Se-Te = Best<br /> Se-Mi-Di = Smith<br /> U-Nu-Da = Under<br /> Yu-Cha-Na = Yu Shan<br /> A-Na-Da = And<br /> U-Ru-Du = Earth<br /> Ma-Di = Made<br /> Di-Si = This<br /> We-Po-No = Weapon<br /> <br /> Thanks to Exthalion's efforts on getting the syllabic translation out of the way I was able to go ahead and try to apply the rules that found in Dreams of the First Age: Lands of Creation. I was thinking that you could substitute a 'b' for a 'v' in favored, but that is only a thing in Spanish from what I know. You are going exclusively for Engrish. 'F' is a good substitute for 'v' at that point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T21:03:12-08:00","id":320343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=320288#post320288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to solve the puzzle, Pat.<br /> <br /> Si-Ni-Da = Cinder<br /> Da = The<br /> Fe-Fa-Du = Favored<br /> Si-O-No = Son<br /> O-Fa = Of<br /> Da = The<br /> Ga-Re-Ta = Great<br /> Ga-Ra-Da = Garda<br /> Ba-Se-Te = Best<br /> Se-Mi-Di = Smith<br /> U-Nu-Da = Under<br /> Yu-Cha-Na = Yu Shan<br /> A-Na-Da = And<br /> U-Ru-Du = Earth<br /> Ma-Di = Made<br /> Di-Si = This<br /> We-Po-No = Weapon<br /> <br /> Thanks to Exthalion's efforts on getting the syllabic translation out of the way I was able to go ahead and try to apply the rules that found in Dreams of the First Age: Lands of Creation. I was thinking that you could substitute a 'b' for a 'v' in favored, but that is only a thing in Spanish from what I know. You are going exclusively for Engrish. 'F' is a good substitute for 'v' at that point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can give you a 98%. Like I said, Si-O-No would translate as Scion, not Son. Otherwise, yep! Nice work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T21:15:38-08:00","id":320351,"title":"","content":"Hey, Exthalion- I seem to remember you posting, something about how you want Feiro to stall for you. Am I imagining things, and if not, did you delete the post, or was it eaten by the Forum?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T10:18:26-08:00","id":320869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=320351#post320351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, Exthalion- I seem to remember you posting, something about how you want Feiro to stall for you. Am I imagining things, and if not, did you delete the post, or was it eaten by the Forum?</div> </div> </div> </div>Appears to have been eaten or whatever else happens. I posted it again with some added stuff about sending a few messages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T15:29:04-08:00","id":321112,"title":"","content":"Discussion of Stannwald's puzzle should be done here. Everyone is encourage to participate in discovering the answer!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T17:52:07-08:00","id":321226,"title":"","content":"On the face of it:<br /> <br /> You can never cross if you <b>drink</b> a poison glass.<br /> You can cross if you <b>choose</b> a safe glass.<br /> <br /> So, you choose a glass but do not drink from it and see if you are allowed to cross. Repeat until you find one that works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 11-24-2014, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T19:47:41-08:00","id":321322,"title":"","content":"I would say that Exthalion has a good stab at it. Alternately, you could attempt to test the water of the lake to see if it is alright. If it is, it is a good bet that the glass that seems to have the lake water in it is safe. Then again, you are dealing with Fae. Nothing is particularly certain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T20:01:18-08:00","id":321342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=321322#post321322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say that Exthalion has a good stab at it. Alternately, you could attempt to test the water of the lake to see if it is alright. If it is, it is a good bet that the glass that seems to have the lake water in it is safe. Then again, you are dealing with Fae. Nothing is particularly certain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alternatively, you pour out all the liquids thus leaving <b>glasses</b> that are safe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T21:12:55-08:00","id":321367,"title":"","content":"Such an interesting line of discussion!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T21:47:07-08:00","id":321413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=321367#post321367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Such an interesting line of discussion!</div> </div> </div> </div>There weren't any clues so had to look elsewhere. Also, Stanwald said there were cups behind them, but there were glasses on the table meaning there might be some cups somewhere.<br /> <br /> Also, while it is likely that knowledge of actual tin compounds isn't necessary:<br /> <br /> Stannic chloride is a colorless liquid that fumes on contact with air which may be what the lake and steaming glass is full of. It is poisonous.<br /> The fizzing pink might be one of the tin-iodide compounds which are red-orange.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T08:24:14-08:00","id":321840,"title":"","content":"I think that you really don't need to drink the liquids. The Fae asked for which glasses are poisoned. I think all of them are. Truth be told, I think that's the answer. Remember, he never said that anyone needed to drink any of the glasses. That's the answer. The winning move is not to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"