:{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T17:54:13-08:00","id":351116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=347104#post347104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Phew: posted! Sorry it is so long and comes after so long a silence.<br /> <br /> Noodle: Could you let me know what the stunt ratings are? I burned through almost my entire mote and wp pools and would like a bit of padding when I make my speech before the Boule.<br /> <br /> edit: Also, Dietaku: Yi is treating Tirien as as sure thing at this point. Please don't let him have written a check his rear can't cash <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm working on it. Although, I have to ask, are you trying to get a Wyld Hunt on us?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T17:58:51-08:00","id":351119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=348513#post348513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was certainly loud and flashy, lets hope it works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Therian agents in Novalesk confirm the existence of an Anathema attempting to take control over an already-heretical state. This shocks the Realm garrison in Greyfalls, who rapidly deploy three dragons of medium foot with auxiliaries to join the three already in Theros. The troops intend to join with the Therian light foot that is working up to Legion standards and march east instead of the planned west. <br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi looks upon the weakened Greyfalls garrison and sees his chance. He marshals his troops and marches on the weakened Realm colony. This has been foretold by fate, but Greyfalls was to have emerged victorious over the beastman horde. Now, that future is in doubt. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, a legionnaire marches north. He bore a powerful destiny; that he would die as he delivered the death-blow to one of Ma-Ha-Suchi's lunar lieutenants. Marching north, there is no way for such a destiny to come to pass and it dies stillborn. He wakes, his friends and comrades believing him dead, glowing in waves of ivory and ebony.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 12-26-2014, 09:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T18:00:02-08:00","id":351120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351116#post351116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm working on it. Although, I have to ask, are you trying to get a Wyld Hunt on us?</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't see this until after I posted. <br /> <br /> Heh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T19:43:52-08:00","id":351189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351119#post351119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Therian agents in Novalesk confirm the existence of an Anathema attempting to take control over an already-heretical state. This shocks the Realm garrison in Greyfalls, who rapidly deploy three dragons of medium foot with auxiliaries to join the three already in Theros. The troops intend to join with the Therian light foot that is working up to Legion standards and march east instead of the planned west.<br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi looks upon the weakened Greyfalls garrison and sees his chance. He marshals his troops and marches on the weakened Realm colony. This has been foretold by fate, but Greyfalls was to have emerged victorious over the beastman horde. Now, that future is in doubt.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, a legionnaire marches north. He bore a powerful destiny; that he would die as he delivered the death-blow to one of Ma-Ha-Suchi's lunar lieutenants. Marching north, there is no way for such a destiny to come to pass and it dies stillborn. He wakes, his friends and comrades believing him dead, glowing in waves of ivory and ebony.</div> </div> </div> </div>By my reading:<br /> <br /> Spies in Novalesk confirm what they already knew and should have informed their masters, a lot of anathema are in Novalesk. Given immaculate propaganda and historical evidence the nation is probably already lost.<br /> <br /> Whoever is in charge of Greyfalls does all of no work to build a coalition in support of their little venture, and fails basic pattern recognition given what happened to the Tepet legions.<br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi owes me a favor.<br /> <br /> Fate is so mismanaged that people are getting Abyssal exaltations without actually dying. The Sidereals should probably work on fixing that Living?=Undetermined state error bug pronto.<br /> <br /> The Bronze Faction moves me up the hit list, to a place still behind the Deathknights, the Infernals, the Deathlords, the Bull, and the other pet Solars in the employ of various power players like the Perfect, the Silver Prince, etc.<br /> <br /> I the player kick myself for being poorly trained by past DMs to assume that if X isn't achieved/dealt with immediately it is never going to happen and for not getting into social/political focused games where delaying gratification was expected.<br /> <br /> I the player also wonder what the other sixty some zenith/eclipse castes are doing that it isn't causing the same sort of chaos. If they aren't, and I survive, and might have a good claim on most flamboyant Exalted in Creation.<br /> <br /> Finally: Is there a &quot;common sense&quot; merit I can pay points for that will allow the ST to metaphorically slap me on the back of my head before I do anything an Int 5 Socialize 5 character would know to be so blatantly suicidal and disruptive to international politics.<br /> <br /> (This post is mostly a joke to diffuse my sense of impending doom)<br /> <br /> Edit: I did a little reading and noticed something. One, Theros apparen't doesn't exist as a nation since that entire territory is actually already part of Greyfalls. Brownclay district it seems.<br /> <br /> What the heck does Ma-Ha-Suchi care about Greyfalls? Its the better part of two and a half thousand miles away without a direct river route, requiring a detour of several thousand miles out of the way first.<br /> <br /> How the heck does Greyfalls continue to exist when it is almost impossible for it to reach the Realm without passing through Lookshy's sphere of influence? The impossible, must be first age, road still wouldn't get around that fact.<br /> <br /> Edit 2: I figured out why Yi has been doing things... he/I am thinking like a fairfolk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 12-26-2014, 11:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T21:31:17-08:00","id":351314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351116#post351116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm working on it. Although, I have to ask, are you trying to get a Wyld Hunt on us?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was wondering the same thing. Jensven might be able to take on two novice immaculates. I don't like his odds against any of those dragons of infantry, even the light infantry.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351119#post351119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Therian agents in Novalesk confirm the existence of an Anathema attempting to take control over an already-heretical state. This shocks the Realm garrison in Greyfalls, who rapidly deploy three dragons of medium foot with auxiliaries to join the three already in Theros. The troops intend to join with the Therian light foot that is working up to Legion standards and march east instead of the planned west.<br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi looks upon the weakened Greyfalls garrison and sees his chance. He marshals his troops and marches on the weakened Realm colony. This has been foretold by fate, but Greyfalls was to have emerged victorious over the beastman horde. Now, that future is in doubt.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, a legionnaire marches north. He bore a powerful destiny; that he would die as he delivered the death-blow to one of Ma-Ha-Suchi's lunar lieutenants. Marching north, there is no way for such a destiny to come to pass and it dies stillborn. He wakes, his friends and comrades believing him dead, glowing in waves of ivory and ebony.</div> </div> </div> </div>The third option sounds pretty exciting to me. Also, where the howl is Dace when we need him to deal with Ma-Ha-Suchi? I don't like Tirien's odds of convincing him to just keep walking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T21:54:52-08:00","id":351333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351189#post351189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> By my reading:<br /> <br /> Spies in Novalesk confirm what they already knew and should have informed their masters, a lot of anathema are in Novalesk. Given immaculate propaganda and historical evidence the nation is probably already lost.<br /> <br /> Whoever is in charge of Greyfalls does all of no work to build a coalition in support of their little venture, and fails basic pattern recognition given what happened to the Tepet legions.<br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi owes me a favor.<br /> <br /> Fate is so mismanaged that people are getting Abyssal exaltations without actually dying. The Sidereals should probably work on fixing that Living?=Undetermined state error bug pronto.<br /> <br /> The Bronze Faction moves me up the hit list, to a place still behind the Deathknights, the Infernals, the Deathlords, the Bull, and the other pet Solars in the employ of various power players like the Perfect, the Silver Prince, etc.<br /> <br /> I the player kick myself for being poorly trained by past DMs to assume that if X isn't achieved/dealt with immediately it is never going to happen and for not getting into social/political focused games where delaying gratification was expected.<br /> <br /> I the player also wonder what the other sixty some zenith/eclipse castes are doing that it isn't causing the same sort of chaos. If they aren't, and I survive, and might have a good claim on most flamboyant Exalted in Creation.<br /> <br /> Finally: Is there a &quot;common sense&quot; merit I can pay points for that will allow the ST to metaphorically slap me on the back of my head before I do anything an Int 5 Socialize 5 character would know to be so blatantly suicidal and disruptive to international politics.<br /> <br /> (This post is mostly a joke to diffuse my sense of impending doom)<br /> <br /> Edit: I did a little reading and noticed something. One, Theros apparen't doesn't exist as a nation since that entire territory is actually already part of Greyfalls. Brownclay district it seems.<br /> <br /> What the heck does Ma-Ha-Suchi care about Greyfalls? Its the better part of two and a half thousand miles away without a direct river route, requiring a detour of several thousand miles out of the way first.<br /> <br /> How the heck does Greyfalls continue to exist when it is almost impossible for it to reach the Realm without passing through Lookshy's sphere of influence? The impossible, must be first age, road still wouldn't get around that fact.<br /> <br /> Edit 2: I figured out why Yi has been doing things... he/I am thinking like a fairfolk.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm pretty sure that the Legionnaire is supposed to be a Getimanian, as the &quot;Stillborn Destiny&quot; implies. Also, I doubt Ma-Ha-Suchi would see it like so, probably taking your favor to be NOT joining his club of &quot;People I've stabbed with my Moonsilver Lance.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also, why wouldn't Ma-Ha-Suchi see Greyfalls as a threat? He's an elder Lunar, probably has a few proxy nations in his territory, with a few close enough to the city to threaten it and sate his desire to bring violence to the accursed Scarlet Dynasty.<br /> <br /> As for why or HOW Greyfalls exists? Eh, I dunno. Perhaps Ess'Tee finds them funny?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T22:10:13-08:00","id":351340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351189#post351189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> By my reading:<br /> <br /> Spies in Novalesk confirm what they already knew and should have informed their masters, a lot of anathema are in Novalesk. Given immaculate propaganda and historical evidence the nation is probably already lost.<br /> <br /> Whoever is in charge of Greyfalls does all of no work to build a coalition in support of their little venture, and fails basic pattern recognition given what happened to the Tepet legions.<br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi owes me a favor.<br /> <br /> Fate is so mismanaged that people are getting Abyssal exaltations without actually dying. The Sidereals should probably work on fixing that Living?=Undetermined state error bug pronto.<br /> <br /> The Bronze Faction moves me up the hit list, to a place still behind the Deathknights, the Infernals, the Deathlords, the Bull, and the other pet Solars in the employ of various power players like the Perfect, the Silver Prince, etc.<br /> <br /> I the player kick myself for being poorly trained by past DMs to assume that if X isn't achieved/dealt with immediately it is never going to happen and for not getting into social/political focused games where delaying gratification was expected.<br /> <br /> I the player also wonder what the other sixty some zenith/eclipse castes are doing that it isn't causing the same sort of chaos. If they aren't, and I survive, and might have a good claim on most flamboyant Exalted in Creation.<br /> <br /> Finally: Is there a &quot;common sense&quot; merit I can pay points for that will allow the ST to metaphorically slap me on the back of my head before I do anything an Int 5 Socialize 5 character would know to be so blatantly suicidal and disruptive to international politics.<br /> <br /> (This post is mostly a joke to diffuse my sense of impending doom)<br /> <br /> Edit: I did a little reading and noticed something. One, Theros apparen't doesn't exist as a nation since that entire territory is actually already part of Greyfalls. Brownclay district it seems.<br /> <br /> What the heck does Ma-Ha-Suchi care about Greyfalls? Its the better part of two and a half thousand miles away without a direct river route, requiring a detour of several thousand miles out of the way first.<br /> <br /> How the heck does Greyfalls continue to exist when it is almost impossible for it to reach the Realm without passing through Lookshy's sphere of influence? The impossible, must be first age, road still wouldn't get around that fact.<br /> <br /> Edit 2: I figured out why Yi has been doing things... he/I am thinking like a fairfolk.</div> </div> </div> </div>That post was mostly a joke, to showcase how I look at the consequences of your actions. None of these things are necessarily happening. Believe you me, you guys are making waves... and so are others. Sooner or later, <i>those </i>waves are going to hit you. <br /> <br /> Anyways... in order.<br /> <br /> Greyfalls is kind of mismanaged, but part of what made the Bull of the North such a tough nut to crack is that he had time to build up his forces. They can deploy in force to attack a nation that, under the best of times is at rough parity with their puppet-nation. They likely figure that dealing with the current Fae invasion would weaken you to the point that, combined with the better part of an Imperial Legion, Theros with have a strong advantage. <br /> <br /> Ma-Ha-Suchi's favors to Yi would likely be along the lines of giving him a two day head start. <br /> <br /> I was referencing Getimian Exaltations, about how they're born from Stillborn destinies. It was recently confirmed that they have white-and-black animas. <br /> <br /> Maybe.<br /> <br /> People will keep working, policies have inertia, even when their not actually being pushed. The world will live and evolve as events transpire, even if PCs are not directly involved. For example, one IRL game I was running, the PCs helped a Sidereal deal with some Lintha as payment for services rendered. After fulfilling their duty, they decided to go off and do their own thing rather than keep on going after the Lintha. A while later, they got back in contact with the Sidereal.. who with the aid of another Solar whom they had encountered in the vicinity had taken down that Lintha clan almost completely. At the same time, they had learned that the Lintha had been working with a Deathlord through their ancestors... one who was now wise to Sidereal/Lunar/Solar co-operation and therefore stepped up his game. <br /> <br /> Some of them are causing this much chaos... At this time, another Zenith has set himself up in the ruins of Melevhil, and an Eclipse is marshaling an army of Tiger Warriors in the eastern forests. Others aren't. Look at Orchid; she's all about making money. <br /> <br /> If you want to run things by me before posting them, that's what this thread, PMs and IMing are for!<br /> <br /> Huh. For some reason, I thought that (1) Greyfalls was a lot smaller. Namely, I thought that it didn't extend much further north than Nasaru Reboubt. Also (2) that Greyfalls city was about level [on North-to-south-axis] with a point halfway between Nasaru and Gunzota. This is a thing for the game, if only to keep Things consistent. And that the relationship between Greyfalls and Theros kind of requires at least one or two small nations and Kingdoms between each other (if only to prevent direct annexation).<br /> <br /> For some reason (likely the Greyfalls chapter comic in Compass: Scavenger Lands, and the ending comic of GWM) I though Ma-Ha-Suchi was much closer to Greyfalls. Either way, It would not be out of the question for Ma-Ha-Suchi to have a tribe in the area, run by one of his proteges.<br /> <br /> I'm not entirely sure.<br /> <br /> Yes. It is hilarious. Escpecially given some of the similarities between Yi and Shu-Yin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T22:13:28-08:00","id":351345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351333#post351333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for why or HOW Greyfalls exists? Eh, I dunno. Perhaps Ess'Tee finds them funny?</div> </div> </div> </div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9\">1.1 Ess'Tee is Amused. </span></b></span></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T22:26:53-08:00","id":351355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=351340#post351340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. It is hilarious. Escpecially given some of the similarities between Yi and Shu-Yin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I shall have to flay his essence across the five directions, twist it with soulsteel formed form the ghosts of ten thousand bad goth poets, and them use it to form a hedge around the Mouth of the Void. That should give me time to think of a <i>truly</i> creative punishment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T10:35:10-08:00","id":362634,"title":"","content":"While Invisible Castle is down, we can use this site: <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice</a><br /> <br /> It records dice rolls, and has an Exalted tab to count successes for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T16:08:43-08:00","id":362992,"title":"","content":"Alright. I realized today that I haven't given out experience since like, July. So! Everyone gets 30 experience. Also, since the game has had some serious time constraints, I'm going to remove training time for anything except Essence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T21:52:50-08:00","id":363200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=362992#post362992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright. I realized today that I haven't given out experience since like, July. So! Everyone gets 30 experience. Also, since the game has had some serious time constraints, I'm going to remove training time for anything except Essence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice do we need to wait for some quiet time to learn new charm or can we learn them on the fly ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-08-2015, 08:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T11:02:12-08:00","id":363682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=362992#post362992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright. I realized today that I haven't given out experience since like, July. So! Everyone gets 30 experience. Also, since the game has had some serious time constraints, I'm going to remove training time for anything except Essence.</div> </div> </div> </div>What in the world am I going to do with all that xp? Yeah, I know it seems like a large amount, but it is actually a small amount, all things considered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T12:15:44-08:00","id":367673,"title":"","content":"Ok Dietaku how are we gonna go through this my knowledge of the wyld and the fairfolks is minimal, do you have a plan ? Becouse I don't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","da