eonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=373050#post373050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alirghty, whaddya got?</div> </div> </div> </div>Fastball special (for those who don't know it's an X-men thing) I want Tirien to give Amelia a boost as she jump to cover the most ditance to get closer to the bridge it should draw the goblins to her and give a bit more space to Tirien to move and meet with her, with her soak Amelia should be fine, after we repeat the process as many time as we need to reach the bridge. What do you think ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T14:27:36-08:00","id":374449,"title":"","content":"Noodle: What is your take on UMI? If I throw out Heart-Compelling Method on a crowd, do they all instantly spend the WP because &quot;The Anathema is tampering with my mind!&quot; I am reading the strategy notes about it in the core and... yeah.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, remind me how the free excellency rule works. If you get one charm in a favored/caste ability you get one excellency free right? What about charms that require an excellency?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 01-18-2015, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T15:19:01-08:00","id":374478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=374301#post374301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fastball special (for those who don't know it's an X-men thing) I want Tirien to give Amelia a boost as she jump to cover the most ditance to get closer to the bridge it should draw the goblins to her and give a bit more space to Tirien to move and meet with her, with her soak Amelia should be fine, after we repeat the process as many time as we need to reach the bridge. What do you think ?</div> </div> </div> </div>The funny thing is that yesterday Dietaku was joking about having Tirien just chuck Amelia towards the bridge, only for Amelia to just chuck Dero at Brandt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T15:22:41-08:00","id":374487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div