powers to it would primarily be the domain of using other melee charms with it I think. As for the duration, I don't think errata-ing the length to indefinite would be game-breaking in any measure. At least, compared to the other things I'm letting you guys get away with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:13:59-08:00","id":430752,"title":"","content":"Sorry for my lack of posting, having trouble formulating a quasi-Nietzschean virtue philosophy to motivate the people to become socio-capitalist arete junkies.<br /> <br /> (Or neurotic and unhinged, that is a thing that could happen also)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:24:01-08:00","id":430761,"title":"","content":"Novalesk is already kind of like that, near as I can tell. They're not-Atticans during the period of Socrates, who seem to have an incredibly pragmatic stoic slant to their culture, which is probably why Yi is having so much trouble. He's coming in and demanding immediate fealty to his starry-eyed Solar principality when he's not proven any form of arete, and seems dangerously zealous in his approaches. <br /> <br /> That and he's a goofy foreigner, so they can always fall back on national conservatism to defend against his barbaric Lookshan ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:37:44-08:00","id":430794,"title":"","content":"I noticed, its what inspired the attempt and also what makes it so difficult.<br /> <br /> Your right though, apparently you have to sit under a tree for a few months or drag a magic rock across a sentient desert before you can start hawking pop philosophy. Which means this is the perfect opportunity for personal time!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T17:32:04-08:00","id":430871,"title":"","content":"Something Awesome:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">It was an interesting Calibration to say the least. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Of course, Calibration was always an interesting time</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">, Alamass thought, as he carefully peeled an unsightly strip of bark from the Magnolia. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The elemental popped the bark in his beak-like maw and chewed as he examined the tree. It stood nearly fifty feet tall, towering over the surrounding estate, and its five trunks had intertwined into a towering braid. Much like the body of the Elemental Dragon crawling on its surface. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamas climbed his way up the tree, thick-thorned vines uncoiling from his body to hold onto the tree. Alamass had carefully tended the tree\u2019s Essence for centuries, and returned to the Cabin every Calibration to help it through this time of transition. One of his masters, some centuries ago, had likened Alamass\u2019s task to pruning the tree. While technically accurate, Alamass preferred to think of it as bonsai, but in reverse. For, unbeknownst even to the sorcerously breed warriors guarding the courtyard, the tree Alamass tended was the source of the Demesne that powered all of the Cabin\u2019s wonders. The dragon jumped slightly as a blossom erupted from the tree trunk inches from his head. In mere moments, it opened into a large white flower, and a sweet scent wafted out.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Plucking the flower gently, Alamass scurried down the tree. He clutched the flower gently in his taloned hand, marveling at its beauty, its symmetry. At the bottom , he coiled his long mass into a pile; the closest his serpentine body could get to a sitting position. Alamass cupped his hands together and took in the blossom\u2019s scent. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Strong, but not overpoweringly so</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">, Alamass thought with a smile, </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">just like her</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass reached down slowly and placed the blossom at the base of the tree. Thick, sticky tears welled in his eyes. The elemental dragon closed his eyes, keeping his tears from flowing. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cCherish your existance, little elemental,\u201d Quick-Sword Esmel had told him after saving his life from a monstrous Fae, \u201cthe wheel of reincarnation does not turn for your kind.\u201d She had cared for many, protecting life in all forms. Yet the Dawn-caste dove into battle with almost reckless disregard for her own safety, as if she cared little for her own life. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">No, that wasn\u2019t it, </span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass thought, </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">she counted on others to protect her as she protected them</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">For her, Alamass had sought the secrets of sorcery and of martial arts. The Solar had no armies, no legions at her command; her military consisted entirely of individual heroes, be they Exalted, mortal, or spirit, drawn in by the Solar\u2019s magnetic charisma. Alamass forged himself into a weapon for her, and he became one of her boon companions. He became her aegis, saving her life time and again in repayment of his eternal debt. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">And then he failed. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">A Primordial, who had fled to the Wyld rather than die to Exalted blades or submit with his king, returned to invade Creation. True to her name, Esmel was one of the first to respond, one of the first to launch a counter-offensive against the hordes of war-daevas. On the spot Alamass now sat she had met her foe in battle, and had died. He had planted this tree in her memory, for the Magnolia blossom was her crest. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">It was her favorite.</span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass shook his head to clear out the painful memories of loss and regret. This place alway brought back those painful memories for him; while Esmel was not buried here, he always regarded this place as her Tomb. And so, he returned each Calibration to tend to it. The Elemental Dragon placed each of his hands together, and reached deep into the well of power next to him. And he began to pray.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cMy lady Esmel, your successors grow more distant from you with every incarnation,\u201d Alamass prayed aloud, \u201cI sometimes wonder if they even are the inheritors of your Solar glory. Your newest inheritor has bred artificial heroes with sorcery-\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">A loud grunt from one of the warriors cut off the dragon\u2019s prayer. Enraged at the interruption, Alamass spun around, only to see two of the magical warriors on the ground their heads severed from their bodies. A tall figure, in silvery-blue armor, stood over their corpses. It casually flipped around a slender bloody blade of the same material, wiping the blade on a long cloak. The figure was surrounded by a soft violet corona.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cYou will not find my master here, Reckoner,\u201d Alamass said, drawing himself to his full height. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cYour master is dead, Alamass,\u201d the figure said in a familiar tenor. It reached up and removed it\u2019s helm, revealing the auburn locks and tanned skin of Peerless Ocelot, Chosen of Endings and master of a dozen Styles. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cYour master fell outside the gates of Hollow alongside Kestrel the Slayer, Radiant Prism, Ma\u2019He-kono the Younger, and Horadrum,\u201d the Reckoner said with steely eyes, \u201cthey fell gloriously in battle, as befit their Exalted station.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass drooped slightly, confused, \u201cHollow? But they were suppose to be in Maru-\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cI seek my Master, Towering Falcon,\u201d Ocelot said, cutting off the Dragon, \u201cHe was not in Maru, nor Tarhoun nor any other place I sought to look for him. Is he here?\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass looked at the Reckoner\u2019s panoply. His armor was a magitech wonder, his cloak crafted from the Wyld Sorcery of Kardalla the Librarian. At least three hearthstones glistened in the Sidereal\u2019s armor, and two more along the length of his daiklave. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Sidereal was outfitted for war.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cDid you kill them?\u201d Alamass whispered.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cThat\u2019s irrelevant-\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cDID YOU KILL THEM?\u201d Alamass shouted. Masses of vines uncoiled from his body and lashed about in uncontrollable anger. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cNo, I did not. But I set into motion the events that did,\u201d Ocelot said, his voice pleading, \u201cThe Solars were not themselves. They have fallen into habits of madness and destruction. Now, do you know where Towering Falcon is? I must finish what I\u2019ve started.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Cherish your existance, little elemental. The wheel of reincarnation does not turn for your kind. </span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Some things are more important than that</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Alamass thought. He lunged at Ocelot, using his coiled lower section like a spring. A tornado of vines whipped at Ocelot, venom dripping from his fangs and talons. He had to incapacitate the Reckoner immediately, lest he slay Alamass and continue on his murderous rampage. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Ocelot ducked under the whirling vines, blocked a claw strike with his elbow, and performed a quick side-kick that caused Alamass to fly back into the towering magnolia. Alamass\u2019 vision danced with lights on the impact. A moment later, Alamass\u2019 vision cleared, only to see the Reckoner stalking towards him with blade in hand. He could barely move before Ocelot ran him through, pinning him to the tree. Alamass felt his essence drain from him, flowing from his being into the demesne he had tended. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cI didn\u2019t think so,\u201d Peerless Ocelot shook his head, \u201cI\u2019m sorry, Alamass. You\u2019ve been nothing but a dutiful servant, albeit to a bad master.\u201d With a swift yank he withdrew his blade, but still Alamass felt his essence draining. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cWe\u2019re products of the Solar\u2019s age; an age that is now over,\u201d Ocelot said as he put his helm back on, \u201cIt would be better if we disappeared from history along with them.\u201d Ocelot turned from the fallen spirit and began to walk away. \u201cWhen you wake, tend to your garden,\u201d Ocelot said over his shoulder, \u201cThe world will forget about us and be better for it.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Reckoner leaped into the inky black sky and disappeared from sight but a moment before Alamass faded from consciousness. </span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15W-RsrwxfniG33e8kkSLZCpJ0Gly-MgGoyL_CWMmOkM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A link to the original</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T18:32:05-08:00","id":430958,"title":"","content":"That is awesome !!! Thank you Noodle. So Alamass lost his powers because of a sidereal seems legit do any of the names of people or place have in game importance ? Just in case we come across a very old Peerless Ocelot <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T09:23:08-08:00","id":431264,"title":"","content":"Yeah...This scene with Shadow reminds me of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yMtdHHilNuE\" target=\"_blank\">this.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T10:17:26-08:00","id":431399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=430958#post430958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is awesome !!! Thank you Noodle. So Alamass lost his powers because of a sidereal seems legit do any of the names of people or place have in game importance ? Just in case we come across a very old Peerless Ocelot <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=166980#post166980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;My only information about the Star-chosen is the tales my master told of the Chosen of Saturn, Peerless Ocelot, a Sidereal beholden to his Sifu, Kardalla the Librarian. According to him, Peerless Ocelot was a man of superb skill, able to bring down gods and demons alike with a mere piece of paper, a man whose skill in Martial Arts led to the development of the Five Directional Animal styles, and the architect of a large palace complex somewhere near here&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=300453#post300453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- The Black Beast of Tarhoon has slain over a dozen Geherin warriors in the past month.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've always had in-game importance!<br /> <br /> Though, Peerless Ocelot, assuming he's still alive, is not likely to show up. At least, not now that there aren't any Sidereal PCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T10:31:29-08:00","id":431455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=431264#post431264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah...This scene with Shadow reminds me of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yMtdHHilNuE\" target=\"_blank\">this.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome! I was thinking more of <a href=\"http://youtu.be/cjfv9QWmYLM\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> myself (significantly smaller, of course), but I'm going to have to look more into that1","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T21:32:03-08:00","id":432234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=431455#post431455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Awesome! I was thinking more of <a href=\"http://youtu.be/cjfv9QWmYLM\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> myself (significantly smaller, of course), but I'm going to have to look more into that1</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that is pretty sweet, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T09:54:33-07:00","id":432688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=431399#post431399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They've always had in-game importance!<br /> <br /> Though, Peerless Ocelot, assuming he's still alive, is not likely to show up. At least, not now that there aren't any Sidereal PCs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah man... I hear so much about the guy and I never get to him, it could have make a good NPC encounter assuming he would not just chop our head off.<br /> <br /> If I remember correctly we can buy backgrounds with Exp right ? I have been thinking that Amelia could either use a mentor or a sifu to train her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T10:33:01-07:00","id":432722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=432688#post432688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah man... I hear so much about the guy and I never get to him, it could have make a good NPC encounter assuming he would not just chop our head off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Peerless Ocelot isn't likely to just chop a Solar's head off. His beef was with one particular Solar. He is (1) around 2300 years old and (2) Bronze faction. So I doubt he would be sent on many field missions in Creation, and even if he were, the Golds would try to keep him out of the East. <br /> <br /> Plus, I've had three members of the Fivescore Fellowship show up in Novalesk when it's supposed to be a backwater nation. Adding a fourth would utterly destroy the thin vestiges of that belief in my book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T10:52:08-07:00","id":432758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=432688#post432688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I remember correctly we can buy backgrounds with Exp right ? I have been thinking that Amelia could either use a mentor or a sifu to train her.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can, yes. I just don't require it if you role-play or roll-play it out (though some justification is always nice). <br /> <br /> So, say, for example, in Yi's backstory, he was protected by a minor god of healing that has a snake motif named Asclepius. He was stated to have semi-divine snake servants. So if Yi wanted to get a snake of Asclepius, Exthalion could either pay the exp to buy the familiar and declare that Asclepius (an already established friendly spirit) has sent him a servant to aid in his tasks. Or, Yi could travel back to where he encountered Asclepius, and convince the god to give him one of his servants. Provided he made a good argument and rolled well, Asclepius could give him a servant, giving Yi the familiar background at no exp cost. <br /> <br /> So. Amelia wants a sifu/mentor. You could pay for that, yes. Or you could find a person and convince them to assist. <br /> <br /> Anyways, while we're on the subject of backgrounds:<br /> <br /> Yi gains Backing (Gens Origenon) 1, Mentor 1 (Chancellor Feiro),.<br /> Tirien gains Henchmen 1 (Dero). <br /> Jensven gains Ally 2 (Cinder)<br /> <br /> And what you will get if you keep on your current course of role-play:<br /> Yi is currently building Contacts (Academy), Cult (Novaleski worship)<br /> Tirien is currently building Influence (Vicruith tribes), Cult (Vicruith hero-worship). <br /> Jensven is currently building Face (Novaleski Salles), Contacts (Novaleski Salles), Allies (Maia, &quot;dog&quot;, Five Lictors of the UCS).<br /> Amelia is currently building Influence (Vicruith Tribes), Cult (Vicruith hero-worship).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:21:36-07:00","id":432806,"title":"","content":"Oh Nice I want Amelia to be able to learn the white reaper style even though it does not use swords it's a nice celestial martial art but from what it said in the book it's a rare style no ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:06:12-07:00","id":432881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=432806#post432806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh Nice I want Amelia to be able to learn the white reaper style even though it does not use swords it's a nice celestial martial art but from what it said in the book it's a rare style no ?</div> </div> </div> </div>People you could Learn White Reaper from: <br /> <br /> Celestial war gods<br /> A number of Lunars, particularly members of the Swords of Luna<br /> Powerful elementals (Alamass could know someone)<br /> Powerful terrestrial spirits, be they members of the Silver Pact, Courts allied strongly with the Celestial bureaucracy, members of the retinues of the Terrestrial War gods.<br /> Outcaste Terrestrials who were followers of ancient martial tradition, or learned from people who remember the first age (be it Solars with memories, Lunars Sidereals or spirits who survived the age).<br /> Solars, particualarly those allied with the Cult of the Illuminated. <br /> The Cult of the Illuminated. <br /> Ghosts of people who knew the style. Like Karandros the Reaper for instance.<br /> <br /> Rare is relative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:15:18-07:00","id":432914,"title":"","content":"When you put it like that I guess I'll go have a talk with the directional war god of the east","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:39:27-07:00","id":432950,"title":"","content":"Sunipa? She does use a fire lance as I remember. Alternatively, the solar-friendly former Eastern directional war god, the goddess of wolves who's name eludes me at the moment, went missing during the Usurpation and is presumed dead. Who's to say that she didn't survive?<br /> <br /> Also, I forgot someone.<br /> Demons. So many demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T14:56:12-07:00","id":433178,"title":"","content":"True they said she dissapeared during the usurpation could be fun to find her if she is even in the east, who knows it could be an old friend of Alamass <br /> <br /> but the ghost of karandros the reaper could be an interesting fellow... Even if he is dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-08-2015, 07:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T09:31:05-07:00","id":437111,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-2SZRGuyax0-UDWFghgOom9zpHc0XGlQVZFFIoyzyn4/edit?usp=docslist_api\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...p=docslist_api</a><br /> And here we have Effusive Saffron Crystal, dance ninja extraordinaire. Or so I hope. Noodle and I have talked him over and it looks like he'll be a decent addition to the group!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5005,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","user":"HeavenlyThunder","date":".  Realized a sentence was unnecessary 03-11-2015, 12:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T10:05:19-07:00","id":437154,"title":"","content":"A few things. <br /> <br /> One, only artifact armor gives aggravated soak. <br /> Two, Saffron is from the south, yes? Then why doesn't he know Flametongue? <br /> Three, having some intimacies, if only to philosophies and such, is a good thing at character generation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T10:06:28-07:00","id":437156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=433178#post433178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True they said she dissapeared during the usurpation could be fun to find her if she is even in the east, who knows it could be an old friend of Alamass<br /> <br /> but the ghost of karandros the reaper could be an interesting fellow... Even if he is dead.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep. Though, he might not want to help someone who's allying with the people that killed him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T10:42:27-07:00","id":437205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=432950#post432950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sunipa? She does use a fire lance as I remember. Alternatively, the solar-friendly former Eastern directional war god, the goddess of wolves who's name eludes me at the moment, went missing during the Usurpation and is presumed dead. Who's to say that she didn't survive?<br /> <br /> Also, I forgot someone.<br /> Demons. So many demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you mean Shield of a Distant Day, Goddess of Non-Violent Warfare?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T10:51:19-07:00","id":437227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437205#post437205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you mean Shield of a Distant Day, Goddess of Non-Violent Warfare?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I mean *consults copy of Scroll of Kings* Darunla, goddess of Wolves, whose position Sunipa inherited after she went MIA during the Usurpation. <br /> <br /> ... Unless you're implying that Shield of a Different Day is in fact Darunla in disguise?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T12:21:36-07:00","id":437339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437154#post437154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few things. <br /> <br /> One, only artifact armor gives aggravated soak. <br /> Two, Saffron is from the south, yes? Then why doesn't he know Flametongue? <br /> Three, having some intimacies, if only to philosophies and such, is a good thing at character generation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Terrific. I'll get rid of that. I didn't want to deal with aggravated soak anyway. Saffron doesn't speak Flametongue because A) his home village never spoke it and B) he pretty much grew up in his brothel, which catered to speakers of Low Realm, which is why he speaks that language. Flametongue was something the madam tried to discourage so she didn't 'ruin' any of the prostitutes. Part of why Saffron wanted out: he doesn't like having secrets kept from him. Or anything, really. He knows Rivertongue because he's picked it up as a trade tongue in his travels and Low Realm because it's effectively his native tongue. And C) Saffron's a cavalier twit. What Flametongue he picked up illicitly he forgot because it wasn't as relevant.<br /> <br /> I'll put in those Intimacies. Is there a Compassion-based limit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T13:21:50-07:00","id":437439,"title":"","content":"It's WP + Highest Virtue, as I recall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T14:16:38-07:00","id":437526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437439#post437439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's WP + Highest Virtue, as I recall.</div> </div> </div> </div>WP+Compassion, and I was mistaken about SoaDD, sorry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:58:33-07:00","id":437717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HeavenlyThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437111#post437111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-2SZRGuyax0-UDWFghgOom9zpHc0XGlQVZFFIoyzyn4/edit?usp=docslist_api\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...p=docslist_api</a><br /> And here we have Effusive Saffron Crystal, dance ninja extraordinaire. Or so I hope. Noodle and I have talked him over and it looks like he'll be a decent addition to the group!</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow, this is an odd feeling. Seeing a non-minmaxed character, with less than five dots total in artifacts and a general lack of aptitude in fighting. I-is this real life? Or fantasy? Or have I just been in this game for so long that seeing a well-rounded character seems odd?<br /> <br /> I like the concept, though, Heavenly Thunder, ninja-hos are based ninjas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T17:51:15-07:00","id":437802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437717#post437717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, this is an odd feeling. Seeing a non-minmaxed character, with less than five dots total in artifacts and a general lack of aptitude in fighting. I-is this real life? Or fantasy? Or have I just been in this game for so long that seeing a well-rounded character seems odd?<br /> <br /> I like the concept, though, Heavenly Thunder, ninja-hos are based ninjas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Non-minmaxed? Less than five dots in artifacts? General lack of aptitude in fighting? Other than the last point for Jensven, you have described both of my characters that you have seen here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T18:11:54-07:00","id":437811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437717#post437717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, this is an odd feeling. Seeing a non-minmaxed character, with less than five dots total in artifacts and a general lack of aptitude in fighting. I-is this real life? Or fantasy? Or have I just been in this game for so long that seeing a well-rounded character seems odd?<br /> <br /> I like the concept, though, Heavenly Thunder, ninja-hos are based ninjas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gracias. And though my username doesn't reflect it, Fin is the name I go by. Shorter, you know? Saf was conceived when I thought &quot;The Wyld revolves around narrative. How about I create a character whose shtick is that he loves to perform stories?&quot; I only even added the Dodge dots because it was a Caste thing and he needed to be able to get out of the way when someone got stabby.<br /> <br /> I have since added Intimacies and removed any mention of Aggravated soak.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T21:05:08-07:00","id":437977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437802#post437802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Non-minmaxed? Less than five dots in artifacts? General lack of aptitude in fighting? Other than the last point for Jensven, you have described both of my characters that you have seen here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I should apologize, you're right. I think I was thinking &quot;Super-specialist,&quot; and while he's not gotten max in everything, I still think of Prodigial as an expert Necromancer. Plus, hey, Jensven is probably the fightiest guy in FaN, so there's that, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T21:29:38-07:00","id":437998,"title":"","content":"In my own defense, crafting requires specialization in Exalted. Lowest of three attributes, minimums in three (or 4) abilities, time and material costs, etc.<br /> <br /> Its almost like they don't want people to rebuilt the fallen age of the ancients by hammering sand into semiconductors.<br /> <br /> Edit: But that does sound like a great name for a charm in Modern or Heaven's Reach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-12-2015, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T20:26:51-07:00","id":439296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=437977#post437977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should apologize, you're right. I think I was thinking &quot;Super-specialist,&quot; and while he's not gotten max in everything, I still think of Prodigial as an expert Necromancer. Plus, hey, Jensven is probably the fightiest guy in FaN, so there's that, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did build Prodigal that way. However, I did also not make him good with a sword, which is a very big temptation with Ex2.5.<br /> <br /> With Jensven, the idea was to have him be a guardian first, then have a dog, then have a broad range of other stuff. I think he turned out well. Oddly enough, I always have trouble distributing background dots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T08:43:14-07:00","id":439972,"title":"","content":"That was unexpected of Tirien Dietaku, why does she try to shield Amelia ? I mean she has a glowing sword in her hand and a golden power armor it doesn't exactly scream helpless. I just find the situation funny that a great hairy beast is stepping in front of her to shield her from a shy drunk Fae when Dero is right there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Noodle can magitech artifact have evocation charm ? I remember you talking about evocation.<br /> <br /> Welcome to the game Heavenly Thunder hope you have fun with us <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\"