sort of thing. HARD.</div> </div> </div> </div>So your &quot;allegiance is to the Republic, to democracy!&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Says the guy planing to become a God-King.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-01-2015, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T22:11:57-07:00","id":536503,"title":"","content":"The Rumor mill turns again!<br /> <br /> <b>Geherin #6<br /> At least one true</b><br /> - The Silver Horned Mother is the lover of the Squirrel-men\u2019s mad god-king<br /> - Some Geherin warriors practice an ancient art that allow them to grow new limbs and duplicates<br /> - The Geherin are allied with a nation of intelligent monkeys that live upon a nearby mountain<br /> - A young Geherin warrior has tamed the dread wyld-beast Haerandel, Kiln of Hope and Envy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 06-08-2015, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T09:35:36-07:00","id":539652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <d