in regards to the rumors:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=129276#post129276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Ordon sits upon a portal to an alien world of darkness and metal. A Realm of Brass and Shadows, if you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>This rumor can be read as referring to Autochthonia (and admittedly with the last comment, I <i>encouraged </i>such a reading), but did not state such. Indeed, there have been several references to some gods, behemoths and other beings who fought alongside the Primordials being turned into mini-Malfeas's in the printed material. The Eyeless Face, for example. This could be in reference to a such a realm. Perhaps this being was one of Autochthon's trusted godly subordinates, and/or a being he crafted to be his aide and apprentice. Perhaps they betrayed Autochthon and his rebellion, and sought to grant the secret of Exalting mortals unto the Holy Tyrant, and were imprisoned for their crimes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T16:20:15-07:00","id":545951,"title":"","content":"I am fine with advancing to the morning.<br /> <br /> Out of curiosity, was there any part of that one post you really liked? I like to try to repeat the good and leave off the bad.<br /> (If I forgot to answer when you asked me that question, I really like those asides where something Yi does has an effect somewhere beyond his immediate environs.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T16:33:34-07:00","id":546000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=545544#post545544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Ordon #6<br /> At least one True</b><br /> - Ordon is built upon a large network of natural caves<br /> - Ordon is marshaling its forces in an attempt to invade Novalesk<br /> - Ordon has uncovered a fully functional, autonomous Warstrider<br /> - Ordon is built upon an airborne city-ship from the First Age</div> </div> </div> </div>Yay rumors !!! The first could explain why the ordoni never lost a defensive war, the second would be fun the I think the last two are not likely. Also can your anima banner be used in offensive ways ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","n