 mojo he could aid Amelia with and it'd be nice to get in on that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honor system is fine by me, but if you'd prefer to use a provable roller, RP nation's got a pretty nice one too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T20:33:06-07:00","id":546394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=546295#post546295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That one I know of and it's on my list of charms to get. If you've read/watch Naruto shippuden then I meant susano-like offensive. I was thinking something like a war charms or a charm tree wwith each charm granting a new ability for it or something. (Not very original I know but I like it sue me)</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon Wracking Glory, an upgrade to Phantom Conjuring Performance that lets you make attacks against all Creatures of Darkness who can perceive you. The Abyssal version Withering Phantasmagoria does the same to mortals.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Original