[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T21:06:25-07:00","id":650890,"title":"","content":"Can we give the ST stunt dice?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T21:10:02-07:00","id":650892,"title":"","content":"Hey, y'all! <br /> <br /> While I was reviewing my potential plot-hook doc, I noticed a major gap for most of our PCs! Namely that of family.<br /> <br /> It's kind of a moot point for Saffron, and Dietaku's already given me more than enough information for Tirien. But Ameila's and Jensven's backstories don't go into the fates (or compositions) of their families after the events that befell their villages. And while Yi's backstory and actions seem to imply a lack of immediate family, I don't want to presume. <br /> <br /> So, tell me of your PCs' families!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T21:13:27-07:00","id":650894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=650890#post650890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can we give the ST stunt dice?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to, but I'm not sure you want me to have the army of akuma I'm about to drop on you Stunting. <br /> <br /> ... Wait, did I say that out loud?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-04T09:20:01-07:00","id":651368,"title":"","content":"Yi's parents are probably alive. They are somewhere upriver of Lookshy, that is all he remembers. (Which of course means that I am secretly prince of Theros or something. I know what secret backstory parents are for.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-04T12:01:14-07:00","id":651592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651368#post651368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yi's parents are probably alive. They are somewhere upriver of Lookshy, that is all he remembers. (Which of course means that I am secretly prince of Theros or something. I know what secret backstory parents are for.)</div> </div> </div> </div>That is exactly what secret backstory parents are for! But what about siblings? Any known ones?<br /> <br /> This also makes me wonder about the exact circumstances that caused Yi to move to Lookshy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-04T13:23:24-07:00","id":651739,"title":"","content":"Obviously a combination of a dark ritual planed by the evil infernalist sorcerer vizier to regain her youth, the assassination plots of the various cadet family branches, at least three prophecies that specify something bad would happen to me or the kingdom if I wasn't sent away, the demands of an angry god who felt slighted for something, conflicting oaths to different Fey courts, a demand from Lookshy for a political hostage, and an honest wish for a good education for a bright child.<br /> <br /> There are probably some treacherous servants in there somewhere. There always are in these sorts of things.<br /> <br /> (Pardon me, I seem to be infected by a Raksha using Assumption of Dreams and Passions.)<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> As for siblings: Drama demands that I fail to remember them until our dramatic reunion when it turns out we had an amazingly close relationship that never crossed my mind in the intervening years.<br /> <br /> We are also due for a high powered wuxia fight between Yi's current goddess girlfriend and the Terrestrial guy he spend most of his adult life pining after.<br /> <br /> (The Raksha, it won't go away!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 09-04-2015, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-04T13:50:40-07:00","id":651753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651739#post651739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obviously a combination of a dark ritual planed by the evil infernalist sorcerer vizier to regain her youth, the assassination plots of the various cadet family branches, at least three prophecies that specify something bad would happen to me or the kingdom if I wasn't sent away, the demands of an angry god who felt slighted for something, conflicting oaths to different Fey courts, a demand from Lookshy for a political hostage, and an honest wish for a good education for a bright child.<br /> <br /> There are probably some treacherous servants in there somewhere. There always are in these sorts of things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if I were to play this completely straight, I'm afraid that Yi couldn't be from Theros, as the Realm would but into any attempt by Lookshy to mess with their satrapies. Or, at least they would have at that point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651739#post651739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Pardon me, I seem to be infected by a Raksha using Assumption of Dreams and Passions.)</div> </div> </div> </div>... Wait, so you're saying that you haven't been a Raksha using Assumption of Dreams and Passion this whole time?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651739#post651739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit:<br /> As for siblings: Drama demands that I fail to remember them until our dramatic reunion when it turns out we had an amazingly close relationship that never crossed my mind in the intervening years.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, if say, a blind seeress walked up to Yi and told him he would be slain by his brother, would he go all &quot;No! My dear brother Usuke (with whom I shared countless fond memories together) would never do such thing!&quot; or would he be more like &quot;I have no brother, old woman&quot;?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651739#post651739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are also due for a high powered wuxia fight between Yi's current goddess girlfriend and the Terrestrial guy he spend most of his adult life pining after.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh. I don't think that Larissa would fight Zhan. She'd be more happy for her nephew that he found someone willing to fight for him. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=651739#post651739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(The Raksha, it won't go away!)</div> </div> </div> </div>Seriously, you weren't a Raksha all along?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-06T14:46:33-07:00","id":654465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=650892#post650892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, y'all!<br /> <br /> While I was reviewing my potential plot-hook doc, I noticed a major gap for most of our PCs! Namely that of family.<br /> <br /> It's kind of a moot point for Saffron, and Dietaku's already given me more than enough information for Tirien. But Ameila's and Jensven's backstories don't go into the fates (or compositions) of their families after the events that befell their villages. And while Yi's backstory and actions seem to imply a lack of immediate family, I don't want to presume.<br /> <br /> So, tell me of your PCs' families!</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly! I would be more than happy to tell you this. I would rather do it in a private message. This way it is a surprise for the rest of the group, not that it is particularly surprising, creative, or innovative, mind.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=650894#post650894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you want to, but I'm not sure you want me to have the army of akuma I'm about to drop on you Stunting.<br /> <br /> ... Wait, did I say that out loud?</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought the ST was free to grant stunt dice to NPCs as they saw fit anyway...Correct me if I am wrong on that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 09-06-2015, 09:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T15:45:04-07:00","id":668900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=654465#post654465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought the ST was free to grant stunt dice to NPCs as they saw fit anyway...Correct me if I am wrong on that one.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right... to a point. I can grant Stunts to NPCs, but I've never found it to be a good idea. I only really give stunts dice to major allies, rivals and antagonists. Examples in FAN include Artemia, The Bone Monarch, Origenes, and Dero. Even then, I tend to cap them at one-die stunts.<br /> <br /> You'll note that I didn't put any Fae in that list. That's because they have the Style Background, which I can and do abuse. Maliciously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:27:18-07:00","id":669918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=650892#post650892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, y'all!<br /> <br /> While I was reviewing my potential plot-hook doc, I noticed a major gap for most of our PCs! Namely that of family.<br /> <br /> It's kind of a moot point for Saffron, and Dietaku's already given me more than enough information for Tirien. But Ameila's and Jensven's backstories don't go into the fates (or compositions) of their families after the events that befell their villages. And while Yi's backstory and actions seem to imply a lack of immediate family, I don't want to presume.<br /> <br /> So, tell me of your PCs' families!</div> </div> </div> </div>Haven't really though about it pretty normal farmers multiple siblings I guess ? Other than that not a clue yet but working on it but don't expect much her origins are supposed to be humble..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 09-18-2015, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T19:02:57-07:00","id":670413,"title":"","content":"In point of fact, Saffron might not have family, but he's got a madam and former coworkers from his brothel/theater days. Chiaroscurans who cater(ed) to Dynasts are probably some interesting people, right? Or the family of the Wood Aspect he slew might come after him... Dunno if you need or want any plot hooks in the form of people, but I'm definitely up to writing something up if you do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5005-heavenlythunder","name":"HeavenlyThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T20:09:42-07:00","id":670434,"title":"","content":"Still alive, and still playing, just caught up with classwork and job. Will post soon, I promise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T20:33:04-07:00","id":670441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HeavenlyThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation?p=670413#post670413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In point of fact, Saffron might not have family, but he's got a madam and former coworkers from his brothel/theater days. Chiaroscurans who cater(ed) to Dynasts are probably some interesting people, right? Or the family of the Wood Aspect he slew might come after him... Dunno if you need or want any plot hooks in the form of people, but I'm definitely up to writing something up if you do.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to write up info on Saf's friends/colleagues in Charascuro, or info on the one Dynast he killed, by all means. Anything you guys give me make my life a lot easier. I may even give out bonus exp, if I'm sufficiently impressed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T20:58:21-07:00","id":670447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcod